#. Old Schoolhouse Mystery
msgctxt "#23 quest"
msgid "旧校舎地下の調査"
msgstr ""

#. I have reason to believe that strange
#. phenomena have been occurring in
#. the old schoolhouse of late.
#. 
#. As such, I would like to request
#. that one or more combat-ready students
#. look into this and report back to me.
#. 
#. For more details, come see me in my
#. office on the first floor of the main
#. building.
#.                  --Principal Vandyck
msgctxt "#23 desc"
msgid ""
"学院の裏手にある《旧校舎》の地下で\n"
"　不可思議な現象が起こっておるらしい。\n"
"\n"
"　そこで、腕の立つ生徒に調査を頼みたい。\n"
"\n"
"　詳しくは、本校舎１Ｆにある\n"
"　学院長室まで聞きに来てくれたまえ。\n"
"　　　　　　　　　　──ヴァンダイク学院長"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・Principal Vandyck entrusted me with the key to
#. the old schoolhouse. It seems as though strange
#. things are afoot in there, so I'm going to need
#. to check it out.
msgctxt "#24 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・ヴァンダイク学院長から旧校舎の鍵を預かった。\n"
"　何やら色々と不思議な現象が起きているようだが……\n"
"　とりあえず探索してみよう。"
msgstr ""

#. I made my way to the staircase room and
#. something is definitely weird here.
msgctxt "#25 step"
msgid "・階段部屋にやってきたが……どうやら様子がおかしい。"
msgstr ""

#. The structure of the building
#. appears to have changed completely...
#. I should explore everywhere I can.
msgctxt "#26 step"
msgid ""
"・やはり内部の構造が完全に変わってしまったようだ。\n"
"　……とにかく行ける所まで行ってみよう。"
msgstr ""

#. I defeated a powerful foe in what seemed
#. to be the deepest area of the ruins.
#. Now's a good time to head back out.
msgctxt "#27 step"
msgid ""
"・終点と思われる場所にて、強力な敵を倒した。\n"
"　とりあえず、いったん旧校舎から出よう。"
msgstr ""

#. I reported the results of my
#. investigation to Principal Vandyck!
msgctxt "#28 step"
msgid "・ヴァンダイク学院長に探索の結果を報告した！"
msgstr ""

#. Orbal Delivery
msgctxt "#29 quest"
msgid "導力器の配達"
msgstr ""

#. I've just finished repairing a bunch
#. of orbal tech here at the Engineering
#. Club, but I need someone to deliver
#. everything.
#. 
#. Stop by the engineering building (left
#. of the Student Union building) and I'll
#. tell you more.
#.             --George, Year 2, Class III
msgctxt "#29 desc"
msgid ""
"技術部の方で修理した各種導力製品を、\n"
"　それぞれの持ち主の元に配達して欲しい。\n"
"\n"
"　まずは学生会館の左手にある\n"
"　技術棟まで来てくれ。\n"
"　　　　　　　　　──２年Ⅲ組・ジョルジュ"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・George gave me three items to deliver:
#. 1) An orbal scale, to be delivered to Nicholas,
#. head of the Cooking Club. I'll find him in the
#. home ec room on the second floor of the main
#. building.
#. 2) An antique orbal lamp, which is bound for
#. Micht at the pawn shop.
#. 3) An orbal wristwatch belonging to Michael,
#. the director of Radio Trista.
msgctxt "#30 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・ジョルジュ先輩から修理品を３つ預かり、\n"
"　代わりに配達することに。\n"
"　届け先はそれぞれ以下。\n"
"　①『導力計量器』\n"
"　　本校舎２階の家庭科室：調理部・ニコラス部長\n"
"　②『アンティークの導力灯』\n"
"　　質屋《ミヒュト》\n"
"　③『導力腕時計』\n"
"　　ラジオ局《トリスタ放送》：ディレクターのマイケルさん"
msgstr ""

#. I delivered the orbal scale to Nicholas.
msgctxt "#31 step"
msgid "・導力計量器をニコラス部長に届けた。"
msgstr ""

#. I delivered the antique orbal lamp to Micht.
msgctxt "#32 step"
msgid "・アンティークの導力灯をミヒュトさんに届けた。"
msgstr ""

#. I delivered the orbal wristwatch to Michael.
msgctxt "#33 step"
msgid "・導力腕時計をマイケルさんに届けた。"
msgstr ""

#. I've delivered all three items safe and sound.
#. Better tell George.
msgctxt "#34 step"
msgid ""
"・荷物を３つ、全て届けた。\n"
"　ジョルジュ先輩に報告しよう。"
msgstr ""

#. Checked in with George. Request complete!
msgctxt "#35 step"
msgid "・ジョルジュ先輩に報告し、依頼を達成した！"
msgstr ""

#. A Noteworthy Loss
msgctxt "#36 quest"
msgid "落とした学生手帳"
msgstr ""

#. I kind of dropped my student notebook,
#. and now I can't find it anywhere.
#. 
#. Would anyone be willing to help me look?
#. 
#. I'll be looking for it on the first floor
#. of the Student Union building, and I'd
#. really appreciate it if someone lent me
#. a hand.
#.               ~Colette, Year 1, Class IV
msgctxt "#36 desc"
msgid ""
"学生手帳をどこかで落としてしまい、\n"
"　いまだに見つからない状況です。\n"
"\n"
"　どうか捜索に協力してもらえませんか？\n"
"\n"
"　先に学生会館の１階を探しているので、\n"
"　時間があれば話を聞きに来てください。\n"
"　　　　　　　　　　──１年Ⅳ組・コレット"
msgstr ""

#. Colette filled me in on what happened and we
#. agreed to split up and search. I'll be checking
#. the main building and focusing on corridors
#. and rest areas. She has an inkling that it's
#. on the second floor, but we'll see.
msgctxt "#37 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・コレットさんから事情を聞いた。\n"
"　心当りを分担して捜し、こちらは本校舎を担当することに。\n"
"　廊下や休憩スペースを重点的に探そう。\n"
"　本人曰く、２階が怪しいらしい。"
msgstr ""

#. I found Colette's student notebook on the
#. second floor of the main building. I better
#. take it back to her.
msgctxt "#38 step"
msgid ""
"・本校舎の２階でコレットさんの学生手帳を発見。\n"
"　本人の元へ届けよう。"
msgstr ""

#. Colette's notebook is back in her hands!
msgctxt "#39 step"
msgid "・コレットさんに手帳を渡し、依頼を達成した！"
msgstr ""

#. Story of Seasoning
msgctxt "#40 quest"
msgid "切れた調味料の調達"
msgstr ""

#. Fred at Kirshe's told me that he's fresh
#. out of the passion leaves he uses as
#. seasoning and he needs them a.s.a.p.
#. 
#. Nicholas is the head of the Cooking
#. Club, maybe he has some to spare...
msgctxt "#40 desc"
msgid ""
"《キルシェ》のフレッドさんが、\n"
"　『パッションリーフ』という調味料を\n"
"　切らしてしまい困っているとのこと。\n"
"\n"
"　とりあえず、調理部の\n"
"　ニコラス部長を頼ってみよう。"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・Nicholas thinks there might be some
#. in the cafeteria. It's worth a shot.
msgctxt "#41 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・ニコラス部長によると、\n"
"　学生食堂にあるかもしれないとのこと。\n"
"　さっそく行ってみよう。"
msgstr ""

#. Once I'd explained the situation, Ramsay was
#. happy to give me some passion leaves. I need
#. to get these to Fred!
msgctxt "#42 step"
msgid ""
"・ラムゼイさんに事情を話し、\n"
"　パッションリーフを譲ってもらった。\n"
"　フレッドさんの元へ届けに行こう。"
msgstr ""

#. I gave Fred the seasoning he needed!
msgctxt "#43 step"
msgid "・フレッドさんにパッションリーフを届けた！"
msgstr ""

#. East Celdic Highway Monster
msgctxt "#44 quest"
msgid "東ケルディック街道の手配魔獣"
msgstr ""

#. A dangerous monster has appeared near
#. the highway and is making it very
#. difficult for us to harvest our crops.
#. Could someone please help us?
#. 
#. Monster: Scary Dinosaur
#. Location: A plateau near the East Celdic
#. Highway.
#. 
#. My house is alongside the East Celdic
#. Highway, so please stop by if you can.
#.                          --Syro
msgctxt "#44 desc"
msgid ""
"街道の近くに現れた大型魔獣が\n"
"　収穫の妨げとなって困っております。\n"
"　どうか退治して頂けないでしょうか。\n"
"\n"
"　魔獣：【スケイリーダイナ】\n"
"　場所：東ケルディック街道・はずれの高台\n"
"\n"
"　退治が済みましたら直接ご連絡ください。\n"
"　我が家は東ケルディック街道の\n"
"　道沿いにございます。\n"
"　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　──サイロ"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・We asked Syro to tell us everything he knew
#. about the monster. It sounds even more dangerous
#. than the name suggests, so we have to make sure
#. that we're ready to face it.
msgctxt "#45 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・サイロさんから魔獣について話を聞いた。\n"
"　かなり危険な相手らしいので、準備を万全に整えよう。"
msgstr ""

#. Monster defeated! It wasn't really THAT scary...
msgctxt "#46 step"
msgid ""
"・手配魔獣を退治した！\n"
"　依頼者のサイロさんに報告しよう。"
msgstr ""

#. We told Syro the details of our battle,
#. completing his request!
msgctxt "#47 step"
msgid "・サイロさんに報告し、依頼を達成した！"
msgstr ""

#. Any Bright Ideas?
msgctxt "#48 quest"
msgid "壊れた街道灯の交換"
msgstr ""

#. I need someone to replace a
#. malfunctioning orbment light in a
#. road lamp for me.
#. 
#. For more details, see me at
#. Oddvin's Arms & Orbal Factory.
#.                           --Samus
msgctxt "#48 desc"
msgid ""
"街道灯の交換作業を行ってもらいたい。\n"
"\n"
"　詳しくは、武具・工房《オドウィン》の\n"
"　サムスまで。\n"
"　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　──サムス"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・Samus gave us an orbment light.
#. ・We need to use it to replace a road lamp
#. near the windmill in front of Lunaria Nature
#. Park. We can find the park at the end of the
#. West Celdic Highway.
#. ・We're going to need to open a maintenance
#. panel before we can replace it, though.
#. The code to unlock it is 466515.
msgctxt "#49 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・サムスさんから交換用の新しい導力灯を受け取った。\n"
"・西ケルディック街道の先にあるルナリア自然公園──\n"
"　その正面にある風車の近くの街道灯が\n"
"　故障しているらしいので、中の導力灯を交換することに。\n"
"・なお、作業するために整備パネルを開く必要があらしい。\n"
"　解除コードは『４６６５１５』。"
msgstr ""

#. As soon as we arrived at the road lamp,
#. monsters began to show up. Luckily, the others
#. agreed to cover me while I replaced the light.
msgctxt "#50 step"
msgid ""
"・街道灯に着くと魔獣が集まってきたが、\n"
"　みんなに背中を預け、そのまま交換作業を行うことに。"
msgstr ""

#. I typed in the code without any problems and
#. replaced the light in a blink.
#. We should go tell Samus.
msgctxt "#51 step"
msgid ""
"・落ち着いて解除コードを入力し、\n"
"　導力灯を素早く交換することができた！\n"
"　サムスさんに報告しに行こう。"
msgstr ""

#. I messed up the code, which slowed down the
#. whole process... At least it all worked out
#. in the end. We should go tell Samus.
msgctxt "#52 step"
msgid ""
"・解除コードを入力に失敗し、\n"
"　導力灯の交換に手間取ってしまった……\n"
"　ともあれ作業は完了。\n"
"　サムスさんに報告しに行こう。"
msgstr ""

#. We told Samus that the light was installed
#. and shining bright!
msgctxt "#53 step"
msgid "・サムスさんに報告し、依頼を達成した！"
msgstr ""

#. For the Common Cold
msgctxt "#54 quest"
msgid "薬の材料調達"
msgstr ""

#. I've run out of some of the ingredients
#. I need to make a particular medicine. I
#. would very much appreciate it if someone
#. could procure more for me.
#. 
#. Please speak with me in the church for
#. further details.
#.                      --Father Zirbel
msgctxt "#54 desc"
msgid ""
"ある薬の材料が不足している。\n"
"　よければ手を貸してもらいたい。\n"
"\n"
"　詳しくは教会まで。\n"
"　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　──ジルベル"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#.  ・Father Zirbel told us about the two
#. ingredients he needs to make his cold
#. medicine, and they are:
#. 1) Bear Claw
#.    Flint at the Grand Market has these.
#. 2) Imperial Carrots
#.    Paul has these in the farmhouse on
#.    the West Celdic Highway.
msgctxt "#55 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・教区長から話を伺った。\n"
"　風邪に効く薬を作るため、以下の２つの材料が必要らしい。\n"
"　①『ベアズクロー』\n"
"　　大市の《フリント薬局》の店主から受け取る。\n"
"　②『皇帝人参』\n"
"　　西ケルディック街道の農家・ポールさんから受け取る。"
msgstr ""

#. Obtained Bear Claw from Flint.
msgctxt "#56 step"
msgid "・フリントさんからベアズクローを受け取った。"
msgstr ""

#. Obtained Imperial Carrots from Paul.
msgctxt "#57 step"
msgid "・ポールさんから皇帝人参を受け取った。"
msgstr ""

#. Now that we have both ingredients, we
#. should go give them to Father Zirbel.
msgctxt "#58 step"
msgid ""
"・材料を２つとも受け取った。\n"
"　ジルベル教区長に渡しに行こう。"
msgstr ""

#. We handed the ingredients over to
#. Father Zirbel. Cold medicine for all!
msgctxt "#59 step"
msgid "・ジルベル教区長に材料を渡し、依頼を達成した！"
msgstr ""

#. A Day as a Merchant
msgctxt "#60 quest"
msgid "大市商人の体験"
msgstr ""

#. At Lymon's suggestion, we agreed to look
#. after his stall at the Grand Market
#. during the evening sale.
#. 
#. We'll have to decide for ourselves how
#. to discount everything... Hopefully
#. we manage to do a good job.
msgctxt "#60 desc"
msgid ""
"大市の商人・ライモンさんの提案で\n"
"　店番を任されることになった。\n"
"\n"
"　それも夕方のセールもということで\n"
"　自分たちの裁量で値引きすることに。\n"
"　気合いを入れて頑張ろう。"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・Not only did I look after the stall,
#. it turns out I'm quite the salesman!
msgctxt "#61 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・何とか店番の仕事をこなした。\n"
"　結果は上々、かなり上手く売ることができたみたいだ。"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・I looked after the stall and did a
#. decent job as a merchant, apparently.
msgctxt "#62 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・何とか店番の仕事をこなした。\n"
"　結果はまあまあ、それなりに売ることができたみたいだ。"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・I looked after the stall, but I don't
#. think I have much of a future in
#. commerce...
msgctxt "#63 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・何とか店番の仕事をこなした。\n"
"　結果は振るわず……もう少し何とかしたかった。"
msgstr ""

#. West Celdic Highway Monster
msgctxt "#64 quest"
msgid "西ケルディック街道の手配魔獣"
msgstr ""

#. A large, ferocious monster has been
#. sighted on the West Celdic Highway.
#. We'd all be happier if someone took
#. it out.
#. 
#. Monster: Zwordar
#. Location: Stone bridge leading to
#. Heimdallr on the West Celdic Highway.
#.                   --Market Manager Otto
msgctxt "#64 desc"
msgid ""
"西ケルディック街道に\n"
"　危険な大型魔獣が出現したので\n"
"　討伐を頼みたい。\n"
"\n"
"　魔獣：【ズウォーダー】\n"
"　場所：西ケルディック街道・\n"
"　　　　帝都方面に通じる石橋\n"
"\n"
"　　　　　　　　　　　──元締め・オットー"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#.  ・Zwordar? More like... Wait, its name was
#. seriously 'Zwordar'? Anyway, it's gone now,
#. we should go tell Otto.
msgctxt "#65 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・手配魔獣を退治した！\n"
"　オットー元締めに報告しよう。"
msgstr ""

#. ・We told Otto that we eliminated Zwordar.
#. ...Sorry, I'm still not over that name.
msgctxt "#66 step"
msgid "・オットー元締めに報告し、依頼を達成した！"
msgstr ""

#. Lost Wallet
msgctxt "#67 quest"
msgid "落し物の財布"
msgstr ""

#. Yesterday, I found a wallet on the floor
#. in front of my stall. Would someone be
#. willing to find its owner for me?
#. 
#. See me at my ceramics stall and I'll
#. tell you more.
#.                           --Lizzie
msgctxt "#67 desc"
msgid ""
"昨日、店の前で落し物の財布を拾いました。\n"
"　どうか持ち主を探し出して、\n"
"　届けてあげてもらえないでしょうか。\n"
"　\n"
"　詳しくは大市の《リジーの陶器店》まで。\n"
"　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　──リジー"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#.  ・Lizzie entrusted us with the wallet she
#. found. It might be a good idea to start our
#. search at the station.
msgctxt "#68 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・リジーさんから落し物の財布を預かった。\n"
"　まずは駅に問い合わせてみよう。"
msgstr ""

#. ・We asked at the station and learned that
#. the wallet's owner had called them. She
#. apparently headed to the Weathercock, so
#. we should do the same.
msgctxt "#69 step"
msgid ""
"・駅で問い合わせると、\n"
"　どうやら持ち主が訪れた後だったようだ。\n"
"　《風見亭》に向かったそうなので、\n"
"　女将に話を聞いてみよう。"
msgstr ""

#. ・Margot told us that Annabelle, the wallet's
#. owner, had just left. She apparently said she
#. was going to check the rest area of the Grand
#. Market next.
msgctxt "#70 step"
msgid ""
"・マゴットさんに話を聞くと、\n"
"　財布の持ち主・アナベルさんと\n"
"　ちょうど行き違いになったことが分かる。\n"
"　次は大市の休憩所を探すと言っていたらしい。"
msgstr ""

#. ・After asking around the rest area, we
#. learned Annabelle had left for the church.
msgctxt "#71 step"
msgid ""
"・大市の休憩所で聞き込み。\n"
"　どうやら女性は七耀教会に向かったようだ。"
msgstr ""

#. ・We finally returned Annabelle's wallet and
#. told Lizzie what had happened.
msgctxt "#72 step"
msgid ""
"・アナベルさんに財布を渡し、リジーさんに報告。\n"
"　依頼を達成した！"
msgstr ""

#. Old Schoolhouse Mystery II
msgctxt "#73 quest"
msgid "旧校舎地下の調査②"
msgstr ""

#. I would like to ask Class VII to
#. continue their investigation of the old
#. schoolhouse from where they left off
#. last month.
#. 
#. I hope you will be able to shed further
#. light onto the secrets within those
#. walls.
#. 
#. You may begin when you see fit, but make
#. sure that you are completely prepared.
#.                  --Principal Vandyck
msgctxt "#73 desc"
msgid ""
"先月に引き続き、旧校舎地下の調査を\n"
"　特科クラス《Ⅶ組》に依頼する。\n"
"\n"
"　かの場所で起きている\n"
"　多くの不可思議な現象について\n"
"　調べを進めてほしい。\n"
"\n"
"　万全に準備を整えた上で、\n"
"　諸君らの判断で始めてくれたまえ。\n"
"　　　　　　　　　　──ヴァンダイク学院長"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・As soon as we entered the stairway room, we
#. realized that the building's structure had
#. changed yet again. Let's take a look at that
#. pedestal thing.
msgctxt "#74 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・階段部屋に入ると、内部の構造がまた変わっていた……\n"
"　とりあえず台座のようなものを調べてみよう。"
msgstr ""

#. We took what turned out to be an elevator
#. down to the second floor. We're going to need
#. to be very, very careful.
msgctxt "#75 step"
msgid ""
"・“昇降機”を使って、第２層まで下りてきた。\n"
"　気をつけて進もう。"
msgstr ""

#. We defeated a powerful enemy in the deepest
#. area of the second floor. That's probably
#. about it for us for the day.
msgctxt "#76 step"
msgid ""
"・第２層の最奥にて、強力な敵を倒した。\n"
"　そろそろ旧校舎を出よう。"
msgstr ""

#. We successfully completed our
#. investigation of the old schoolhouse.
msgctxt "#77 step"
msgid "・旧校舎地下の探索を無事に終えた！"
msgstr ""

#. Substitute Tutor
msgctxt "#78 quest"
msgid "代理教師の要請"
msgstr ""

#. Something urgent has just come up, so
#. I really need someone to take care of
#. tutoring the kid I usually teach.
#. 
#. I'll be waiting in the lower class
#. dorms, so please come see me as soon as
#. you can.
#.                --Klein, Year 2, Class V
msgctxt "#78 desc"
msgid ""
"急用ができたので、できれば\n"
"　家庭教師の仕事を代わってもらいたい。\n"
"　\n"
"　第二学生寮で待っているので\n"
"　詳しくはそちらまで。\n"
"　　　　　　　　　　──２年Ⅴ組・クレイン"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・Klein teaches a boy named Emile who lives
#. in a house near the river south of the Lower
#. Class Dormitory.
#. ・They were going to go over orbal science.
#. As soon as I've brushed up, I should go talk
#. to his mother, Melinda. It probably wouldn't
#. hurt to go over the history of the Reinford
#. Company, either.
msgctxt "#79 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・クレイン先輩から事情を聞く。\n"
"　家庭教師の相手は、第二学生寮の南にある\n"
"　川沿いの民家のエミール君。\n"
"・今日のテーマは『導力学』とのことだが……\n"
"　準備ができたら、母親のメリッサさんの所へ行こう。\n"
"　図書館で導力やラインフォルト社のことを\n"
"　予習しておくといいかもしれない。"
msgstr ""

#. That's one tutored kid! I don't think
#. I made any huge mistakes, and he seemed
#. pretty happy with me as a substitute.
msgctxt "#80 step"
msgid ""
"・代理教師の仕事を無事に終えた。\n"
"　ミスらしいミスもなく、何とか分かりやすく\n"
"　教えることができたみたいだ。"
msgstr ""

#. I finished tutoring Emile. I might've
#. made some mistakes here and there, but he
#. seemed pretty happy to study with me.
msgctxt "#81 step"
msgid ""
"・代理教師の仕事を無事に終えた。\n"
"　少しミスはしてしまったが、何とか分かりやすく\n"
"　教えることができたみたいだ。"
msgstr ""

#. I guess you could call that tutoring...
#. I made a ton of mistakes, though. I
#. don't think I'm very good at this...
msgctxt "#82 step"
msgid ""
"・代理教師の仕事を無事に終えた。\n"
"　ミスが多く、あまり上手く教えることができなかった……"
msgstr ""

#. Book Delivery
msgctxt "#83 quest"
msgid "教官用図書の配達"
msgstr ""

#. A number of books have just arrived
#. for Thors faculty and I would like
#. assistance in delivering them.
#. 
#. Inquire at Keynes' Bookstore.
#.                        -Keynes
msgctxt "#83 desc"
msgid ""
"士官学院の方から注文を受けた\n"
"　教官用図書を入荷したので、\n"
"　それぞれ個別の配達をお願いします。\n"
"　\n"
"　詳しくは《ケインズ書房》のケインズまで。\n"
"　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　──ケインズ"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・Keynes says he lost the order slip
#. telling him who to deliver each book to.
#. In other words, he wants me to guess
#. which faculty member each book belongs
#. to based on their title alone.
msgctxt "#84 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・伝票を紛失したため、教官用図書の\n"
"　配達先が分からなくなってしまったとのこと。\n"
"　全部で５冊──タイトルから注文者を推察し、\n"
"　それぞれの教官の元に届けよう。"
msgstr ""

#. Delivered 'Behind the War of
#. the Lions' to Instructor Thomas.
msgctxt "#85 step"
msgid "・『獅子戦役の謎』をトマス教官に届けた。"
msgstr ""

#. Delivered 'Modern Art: The
#. Complete Works' to Instructor Mary.
msgctxt "#86 step"
msgid "・『近代美術全集』をメアリー教官に届けた。"
msgstr ""

#. Delivered 'Topical Science'
#. to Instructor Makarov.
msgctxt "#87 step"
msgid "・『新解サイエンス』をマカロフ教官に届けた。"
msgstr ""

#. Delivered 'Analyzing Macroeconomics'
#. to Vice Principal Heinrich.
msgctxt "#88 step"
msgid "・『分析・マクロ経済』をハインリッヒ教頭に届けた。"
msgstr ""

#. Delivered 'The Empire's Hottest Spots'
#. to Instructor Sara.
msgctxt "#89 step"
msgid "・『嗚呼、帝国旅情』をサラ教官に届けた。"
msgstr ""

#. Finally delivered all five books.
#. I should let Keynes know.
msgctxt "#90 step"
msgid ""
"・全ての教官用図書の配達を終えた。\n"
"　ケインズさんに報告しよう。"
msgstr ""

#. Reported back to Keynes. I'm done!
msgctxt "#91 step"
msgid "・ケインズさんに報告し、依頼を達成した！"
msgstr ""

#. A Rose by Any Other Name
msgctxt "#92 quest"
msgid "生花の受け取り"
msgstr ""

#. I agreed to pick up some flowers for
#. Linde at Jane's, the flower shop.
msgctxt "#92 desc"
msgid ""
"美術部のリンデの代わりに、\n"
"　商店街の花屋《ジェーン》へ\n"
"　デッサン用の生花を受け取りに行くことに。"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・Linde caught me on my way out the gate
#. and asked me to buy a grand rose, too.
msgctxt "#93 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・正門前でリンデに呼び止められ、\n"
"　追加で『グランローズ』という花を買ってくることに。"
msgstr ""

#. I picked up all the flowers Linde
#. asked for from the florist. I should
#. deliver them as soon as I can.
msgctxt "#94 step"
msgid ""
"・花屋で目的の花を受け取った。\n"
"　美術室に戻って、リンデに届けよう。"
msgstr ""

#. It turns out the girl asking for the
#. grand rose wasn't Linde after all. It
#. was her (evil?) twin Vivi...
#. ・At least I managed to deliver the
#. flowers Linde really did ask for.
msgctxt "#95 step"
msgid ""
"・俺にグランローズを頼んだのは、\n"
"　リンデではなく、双子の妹のヴィヴィだった……\n"
"・とにかく、これにてお使いは終了だ。"
msgstr ""

#. Aurochs Canyon Monster
msgctxt "#96 quest"
msgid "オーロックス峡谷道の手配魔獣"
msgstr ""

#. A violent monster has been seen roving
#. the Aurochs Canyon Path, and the
#. Kreuzen Provincial Army would like it
#. eliminated.
#. 
#. Monster: Fate Spinner
#. Location: Atop a cliff partway
#. along the Aurochs Canyon Path.
#. 
#. Once the monster has been exterminated,
#. please report to the soldiers at
#. Aurochs Fort.
msgctxt "#96 desc"
msgid ""
"オーロックス渓谷に危険な魔獣が出現した。\n"
"　クロイツェン州領邦軍より退治を依頼する。\n"
"　\n"
"　魔獣：【フェイトスピナー】\n"
"　場所：オーロックス峡谷・中間地点の崖上\n"
"\n"
"　なお、魔獣退治を終えた後は\n"
"　オーロックス砦の兵士まで報告のこと。"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・We spun that monster right around! Let's
#. head to Aurochs Fort to let them know.
msgctxt "#97 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・手配魔獣を退治した！\n"
"　《オーロックス砦》に報告に行こう。"
msgstr ""

#. We reported the monster's defeat to the
#. provincial army, fulfilling their request.
msgctxt "#98 step"
msgid "・領邦軍に報告し、依頼を達成した！"
msgstr ""

#. Put a Ring on it
msgctxt "#99 quest"
msgid "穢れなき半貴石"
msgstr ""

#. I'd like someone to help me find a
#. particular semi-precious stone.
#. 
#. For more details, talk to me at
#. Turner's Jewelers.
#.                          --Bruc
msgctxt "#99 desc"
msgid ""
"とある半貴石の調達をお願いしたい。\n"
"\n"
"　詳しくは《宝飾店ターナー》の\n"
"　ブルックまで。\n"
"　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　──ブルック"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・We agreed to find a Dryad's Tear
#. for Bengt's wedding ring.
#. ・According to a really shady-looking baron
#. who happened to be in the jewelers' at the
#. time, we can get it from a tree on the North
#. Kreuzen Highway.
msgctxt "#100 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・ベントさんの結婚指輪を作るため、\n"
"　《ドリアード・ティア》と呼ばれる\n"
"　半貴石を調達することに。\n"
"・どうやら北クロイツェン街道の樹木から\n"
"　採取できるらしく、怪しい男爵から目撃情報も得た。"
msgstr ""

#. We found a Dryad's Tear. Let's hurry it
#. back to the jewelers'.
msgctxt "#101 step"
msgid ""
"・《ドリアード・ティア》を手に入れた。\n"
"　宝飾店に戻ろう。"
msgstr ""

#. Bengt's Dryad's Tear ended up inside a
#. count's stomach...
#. ・That wasn't quite the ending we hoped
#. for, but we did what we said we'd do...
msgctxt "#102 step"
msgid ""
"・ベントさんのために手に入れたはずの\n"
"　《ドリアード・ティア》は、\n"
"　伯爵の腹の中に納まってしまった……\n"
"・やるせないが……とにかくこれで依頼は完了だ。"
msgstr ""

#. Addicted to Bath Salts
msgctxt "#103 quest"
msgid "バスソルトの調達"
msgstr ""

#. The Voltaire family even bathes in style,
#. using nothing but the most fabulous bath
#. salts...which we're unfortunately running
#. low on. Will someone procure them for us?
#. 
#. If this strikes your fancy, find me on the
#. terrace outside the Sorciere restaurant.
#.                     --Hasan Voltaire
msgctxt "#103 desc"
msgid ""
"ヴォルテール家の優雅なバスタイムを\n"
"　彩るため、ソルトの調達を頼む。\n"
"\n"
"　詳しくは、レストラン《ソルシエラ》の\n"
"　オープンテラスまで。\n"
"　　　　　　　　　──ハサン・ヴォルテール"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・We should be able to find the
#. bath salts deep into the Aurochs
#. Canyon Path. Might as well take care
#. of the monster while we're there, too.
msgctxt "#104 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・バスソルトは、オーロックス峡谷道の奥で手に入るらしい。\n"
"　手配魔獣の依頼と一緒に片付けよう。"
msgstr ""

#. We've got the bath salts. All we
#. need to do now is deliver them to
#. Hasan when we're back in town.
msgctxt "#105 step"
msgid ""
"・バスソルトを手に入れた。\n"
"　街に戻ったら忘れずに届けよう。"
msgstr ""

#. Bath salts delivered.
#. Another happy customer!
msgctxt "#106 step"
msgid "・バスソルトを届け、依頼を達成した！"
msgstr ""

#. North Kreuzen Highway Monster
msgctxt "#107 quest"
msgid "北クロイツェン街道の手配魔獣"
msgstr ""

#. We have received word that a dangerous
#. monster roams the North Kreuzen Highway.
#. This is bad news for our hotel, so may I
#. ask someone to please take care of it?
#. 
#. Monster: Venus Mantrap
#. Location: The stone bridge leading
#. towards Celdic on the North Kreuzen
#. Highway
#. 
#.    --Richelieu, G.M. of Hotel Esmeralda
msgctxt "#107 desc"
msgid ""
"北クロイツェン街道に、\n"
"　危険な大型魔獣が出没中とのこと。\n"
"　どうか討伐をお願い致します。\n"
"\n"
"　魔獣：【ヴィナスマントラ】\n"
"　場所：北クロイツェン街道・\n"
"　　　　ケルディック方面に通じる石橋\n"
"\n"
"　　　　　　　──《ホテル・エスメラルダ》\n"
"　　　　　　　　　　　総支配人・リシリュー"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・We took care of the Venus Mantrap!
#. I'm sure Richelieu will be thrilled.
msgctxt "#108 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・手配魔獣を退治した！\n"
"　ホテルにいるリシリュー支配人に報告しよう。"
msgstr ""

#. We assured Richelieu that the highway is
#. safe for travel once again.
msgctxt "#109 step"
msgid "・リシリュー支配人に報告し、依頼を達成した！"
msgstr ""

#. The Bite of Nostalgia
msgctxt "#110 quest"
msgid "懐かしのメニュー"
msgstr ""

#. I'd like to request someone's help in
#. gathering a number of ingredients I need
#. to make a particularly nostalgic dish.
#. 
#. For more details, come find me at
#. Sorciere, a restaurant in the central
#. plaza.
#.                    --Hammond.
msgctxt "#110 desc"
msgid ""
"とある懐かしのメニューを作るための\n"
"　材料調達をお願いします。\n"
"　\n"
"　詳しくは中央広場にある、\n"
"　レストラン《ソルシエラ》のハモンドまで。\n"
"　\n"
"　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　──ハモンド"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・We need to gather these ingredients:
#. 1) Globby Fat x5
#.  We can get that from monsters.
#. 2) Healing Herb
#.  We can get this from Sister Tatiana.
msgctxt "#111 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・必要な材料は以下──\n"
"　①『魔獣の油脂』×５\n"
"　　魔獣から手に入れる。\n"
"　②『キュアハーブ』\n"
"　　教会にいるシスター・タチアナから受け取る。"
msgstr ""

#. Sister Tatiana gave us a Healing Herb.
msgctxt "#112 step"
msgid ""
"・シスター・タチアナから\n"
"　『キュアハーブ』を受け取った。"
msgstr ""

#. Once we'd given Hammond the ingredients
#. he treated us to a soup dish originally
#. made by Jusis' mother.
#. ・It's a shame Jusis wasn't with us, but
#. we completed Hammond's request.
msgctxt "#113 step"
msgid ""
"・ハモンド・オーナーに材料を届けると、\n"
"　ユーシスの母親が作ったというスープ料理を\n"
"　振舞ってくれた。\n"
"・ユーシスも一緒だとよかったんだが……\n"
"　とにかく、これで依頼は完了だ。"
msgstr ""

#. The Lost Traveler
msgctxt "#114 quest"
msgid "旅行者の護送"
msgstr ""

#. We ran into a lost traveler named
#. Anton at Aurochs Fort and agreed
#. to escort him back to Bareahard.
#. 
#. He's a little...strange, but that's
#. no reason not to get him there safely.
msgctxt "#114 desc"
msgid ""
"オーロックス砦から帰れずに困っていた\n"
"　アントンさんを保護し、\n"
"　バリアハート市まで護送することになった。\n"
"\n"
"　少し変わった人みたいだが……\n"
"　とにかく無事に送り届けよう。"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・We safely escorted Anton to Bareahard!
msgctxt "#115 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・アントンさんを無事にバリアハートまで送り届けた！"
msgstr ""

#. Old Schoolhouse Mystery III
msgctxt "#116 quest"
msgid "旧校舎地下の調査③"
msgstr ""

#. This month, I would like the members of
#. Class VII to commit themselves to their
#. noble academic pursuits.
#. 
#. Though I know, studious as you all are,
#. I can expect that anyway. So on top of
#. that, I'd like you to continue your
#. exploration of the old schoolhouse and
#. report your findings to me.
#.                  --Principal Vandyck
msgctxt "#116 desc"
msgid ""
"先月に引き続き、旧校舎地下の調査を\n"
"　特科クラス《Ⅶ組》に依頼する。\n"
"\n"
"　かの場所で起きている\n"
"　多くの不可思議な現象について\n"
"　調べを進めてほしい。\n"
"\n"
"　万全に準備を整えた上で、\n"
"　諸君らの判断で始めてくれたまえ。\n"
"　　　　　　　　　　──ヴァンダイク学院長"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・We've gained access to a third floor. We
#. should check it out, but we have to be careful!
msgctxt "#117 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・どうやら新たに第３層に進めるようになったらしい。\n"
"　気を引き締めていこう。"
msgstr ""

#. We took down a powerful enemy in the
#. deepest part of the third floor. Might be
#. a good time to head back out.
msgctxt "#118 step"
msgid ""
"・第３層の最奥にて、強力な敵を倒した。\n"
"　そろそろ旧校舎を出よう。"
msgstr ""

#. We completed our investigation for the month!
msgctxt "#119 step"
msgid "・旧校舎の探索を無事に終えた！"
msgstr ""

#. Born to be Orbal
msgctxt "#120 quest"
msgid "導力バイクの能力テスト"
msgstr ""

#. We're testing the orbal bike's
#. capabilities on a highway near Trista.
#. 
#. If you're curious, come talk to us in
#. the engineering building.
#.                    --George & Angelica
msgctxt "#120 desc"
msgid ""
"近くの街道を使って、\n"
"　《導力バイク》の性能テストを行いたい。\n"
"\n"
"　詳しくは、技術部棟まで。\n"
"　　　　　　　　──ジョルジュ＆アンゼリカ"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・I agreed to ride the orbal bike and
#. report on my experience. Although the
#. orbal bike was tuned for Angelica, I
#. rode it perfectly. It was awesome.
msgctxt "#121 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・アンゼリカ先輩に合わせてセッティングされたという\n"
"　導力バイクに乗らせてもらい、結果を報告──\n"
"　特にミスすることなく、上手く操縦することができた。"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・I agreed to ride the orbal bike and
#. report on my experience. Although the
#. orbal bike was tuned for Angelica, I
#. only made a few mistakes. Not bad.
msgctxt "#122 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・アンゼリカ先輩に合わせてセッティングされたという\n"
"　導力バイクに乗らせてもらい、結果を報告──\n"
"　少しミスをしてしまったが、\n"
"　概ね問題なく操縦することができた。"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・I agreed to ride the orbal bike and
#. report on my experience. I know it
#. was my first time riding, but I made
#. more mistakes than I should have...
msgctxt "#123 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・アンゼリカ先輩に合わせてセッティングされたという\n"
"　導力バイクに乗らせてもらい、結果を報告──\n"
"　初めてとはいえ……かなりミスしてしまった。"
msgstr ""

#. The Secret Admirer
msgctxt "#124 quest"
msgid "まだ見ぬ差出人"
msgstr ""

#. I am in need of aid! Some fair maiden
#. has sent me several messages proclaiming
#. her love for me. And who could blame
#. her? I simply must know who she is, so
#. would some kind soul help find her and
#. bring her to me?
#. 
#. More details behind the storage
#. building!
#.      --Vincent Florald, Year 2, Class I
msgctxt "#124 desc"
msgid ""
"この私にラヴレターをくれた\n"
"　人物の正体を突き止め、\n"
"　できれば目の前に連れて来て欲しい。\n"
"　\n"
"　詳しいことは体育倉庫裏で話させてもらう。\n"
"　\n"
"　　──２年Ⅰ組・ヴィンセント・フロラルド"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・I agreed to try to figure out who sent
#. Vincent the love letter.
#. ・The letter came with pressed grand roses,
#. so we decided it would be best to ask the
#. florist who had purchased them.
msgctxt "#125 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・ヴィンセント先輩の依頼で、\n"
"　先輩宛のラブレターの差出人を捜すことに。\n"
"・手紙にはグランローズの押し花が添えられており、\n"
"　まずは花屋《ジェーン》で聞き込みを行うことに。"
msgstr ""

#. I asked the florist and learned that three
#. girls have purchased grand roses from her
#. recently: Beryl from Class III, Vivi from
#. Class IV, and Rosine from Class V.
msgctxt "#126 step"
msgid ""
"・花屋《ジェーン》で、最近グランローズを買った\n"
"　１年生の女子生徒の情報を提供してもらった所、\n"
"　１年Ⅲ組のベリル、１年Ⅳ組のヴィヴィ、\n"
"　１年Ⅴ組のロジーヌの３人が候補に挙がった。"
msgstr ""

#. I asked Beryl, but she doesn't
#. seem to have sent the letters.
msgctxt "#127 step"
msgid "・ベリルに話を聞いたが、差出人ではないようだ。"
msgstr ""

#. I asked Vivi, but she claims that she
#. just bought a rose to harass her sister.
msgctxt "#128 step"
msgid "・ヴィヴィに話を聞いたが、差出人ではないようだ。"
msgstr ""

#. I asked Rosine, but she doesn't
#. seem to have sent the letter.
msgctxt "#129 step"
msgid "・ロジーヌに話を聞いたが、差出人ではないようだ。"
msgstr ""

#. It seems as though none of the first
#. years that bought grand roses are
#. Vincent's mystery girl after all. I
#. should go break the bad news to him.
msgctxt "#130 step"
msgid ""
"・花屋で聞いた３人はいずれも\n"
"　ラブレターの差出人ではなかったようだ。\n"
"　とりあえず、ヴィンセント先輩に報告しよう。"
msgstr ""

#. ...As it turns out, our mystery woman was
#.  an upper class student named Margarita.
msgctxt "#131 step"
msgid ""
"・……ラブレターの差出人は、\n"
"　マルガリータという貴族生徒だった。"
msgstr ""

#. A Sticky Situation
msgctxt "#132 quest"
msgid "大切なステッカー"
msgstr ""

#. I agreed to help Munk find his beloved
#. stickers.
#. 
#. He says they were blown out of his hands
#. on the roof of the main building.
msgctxt "#132 desc"
msgid ""
"ムンクを手伝い、\n"
"　彼の大切なステッカーを探すことに。\n"
"\n"
"　どうやら屋上にいる時に\n"
"　風に飛ばされてしまったらしいが……"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・Munk thinks that one was blown towards
#. the field, another east of the main
#. building, and the last northeast of it.
msgctxt "#133 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・本人曰く１つはグラウンド、\n"
"　あとの２つは本校舎の東と北東に\n"
"　それぞれ飛ばされたそうだ。"
msgstr ""

#. I found one by the engineering building.
msgctxt "#134 step"
msgid "・技術棟の近くでステッカーを見つけた。"
msgstr ""

#. I found one on the northern part of the field.
msgctxt "#135 step"
msgid "・グラウンドの北でステッカーを見つけた。"
msgstr ""

#. I found one in front of the old schoolhouse.
msgctxt "#136 step"
msgid "・旧校舎前でステッカーを見つけた。"
msgstr ""

#. Now that I've found all three stickers,
#. I should go return them to Munk.
msgctxt "#137 step"
msgid ""
"・ステッカーを３枚全て見つけた。\n"
"　ムンクに届けよう。"
msgstr ""

#. I gave Munk his stickers back!
msgctxt "#138 step"
msgid "・ムンクにステッカーを届けた！"
msgstr ""

#. Return to Zender
msgctxt "#139 quest"
msgid "ゼンダー門からの要請"
msgstr ""

#. I have a very important request for
#. Class VII pertaining to a monster
#. prowling the highlands.
#. 
#. Come speak to me in the commander's room
#. at Zender Gate for more information.
#. Be prepared for battle.
#.                    --Zechs Vander
msgctxt "#139 desc"
msgid ""
"特科クラス諸君に、高原に出没する\n"
"　魔獣に関する要請を出させてもらう。\n"
"\n"
"　詳しい説明はゼンダー門・司令室にて。\n"
"　装備などを整えた上で来てくれたまえ。\n"
"　　　　　　　　　──ゼクス・ヴァンダール"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・We were asked to defeat a ferocious monster
#. appearing in a basin east-northeast of Zender
#. Gate. The sooner we take care of it, the better.
msgctxt "#140 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・ゼンダー門の北の窪地に現れる凶暴な魔獣──\n"
"　その討伐こそが依頼の内容だそうだ。\n"
"　さっそく問題の地点に向かおう。"
msgstr ""

#. We let Lieutenant General Zechs know that
#. we exterminated the monster!
msgctxt "#141 step"
msgid "・手配魔獣を退治し、ゼクス中将に報告した！"
msgstr ""

#. Turning Over a New Leaf
msgctxt "#142 quest"
msgid "薬草の調達"
msgstr ""

#. I need ingredients for a very important
#. medicine, and I would like to request
#. that you obtain them for me.
#. 
#. I will tell you more in person, so
#. please come and speak to me at my home.
#.                           --Amr
msgctxt "#142 desc"
msgid ""
"ある大切な薬の材料となる\n"
"　薬草の調達をお願いしたい。\n"
"　\n"
"　詳しい話は直接するから、\n"
"　まずは僕の住居まで来てくれ。\n"
"　　　　　　　　　　　　　　──アムル"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・Amr's medicine wards off an disease
#. endemic to horses in the region, but he
#. can't make it without epona grass.
#. ・Epona grass is recognizable by its
#. yellow flowers and is regularly found in
#. the southern part of the highlands.
#. ・He needs five of them to make the
#. medicine. We better get started.
msgctxt "#143 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・馬の風土病を予防する薬を作るため、\n"
"　《エポナ草》という薬草が必要らしい。\n"
"・高原南部に生えており、\n"
"　黄色い花を咲かせるのが特徴とのこと。\n"
"・必要な数は５つ、さっそく集めてこよう。"
msgstr ""

#. Gathered all five epona grasses!
#. Let's get these back to Amr.
msgctxt "#144 step"
msgid ""
"・エポナ草を５つ集めた！\n"
"　アムルさんの元へ届けよう。"
msgstr ""

#. We delivered the epona grasses to Amr,
#. fulfilling the request, and hopefully
#. helping some horses.
msgctxt "#145 step"
msgid "・アムルさんに薬草を届け、依頼を達成した！"
msgstr ""

#. Delivery to the Watchtower
msgctxt "#146 quest"
msgid "監視塔への配達"
msgstr ""

#. Could someone deliver something to the
#. soldiers in the Imperial Army's
#. watchtower for me?
#. 
#. If so, I'll be at the trading post.
#.                           --Kilte
msgctxt "#146 desc"
msgid ""
"帝国軍の監視塔にいる兵士さんたちへの\n"
"　届け物を頼まれて欲しい。\n"
"　\n"
"　詳しくは交易所のキルテまで。\n"
"　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　──キルテ"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・Kilte entrusted us with a parcel of food
#. that we need to deliver to a soldier named
#. Zats at the watchtower.
msgctxt "#147 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・キルテさんから食料品の詰め合わせを預かった。\n"
"　監視塔にいる兵士・ザッツさんに届けよう。"
msgstr ""

#. When we gave Zats the parcel, he gave us
#. some Erebonian wine in exchange. We should
#. head back and give it to Kilte.
msgctxt "#148 step"
msgid ""
"・ザッツさんに荷物を渡し、\n"
"　代わりに帝国産のワインを受け取った。\n"
"　キルテさんに報告しよう。"
msgstr ""

#. We gave Kilte our report and the wine,
#. completing her request.
msgctxt "#149 step"
msgid "・キルテさんに報告し、依頼を達成した！"
msgstr ""

#. Cameraman Caravan
msgctxt "#150 quest"
msgid "カメラマンの保護"
msgstr ""

#. A visiting photographer by the name of
#. Norton has left for the northern
#. highlands unaccompanied.
#. 
#. I would like you to go after him and
#. ensure his safety, but first, please
#. visit me at my home, as I have more to
#. tell you.
#.                       --Elder Ivan
msgctxt "#150 desc"
msgid ""
"集落に滞在中のカメラマン・ノートン殿が\n"
"　一人で高原北部に出てしまったようだ。\n"
"\n"
"　どうか彼を保護してきてほしい。\n"
"　詳しいことは直接、聞きに来てくれたまえ。\n"
"　\n"
"　　　　　　　　　　　　　──長老・イヴン"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・The elder believes that Norton likely went
#. to get a closer look at the statue in the
#. northern highlands.
msgctxt "#151 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・長老によると、カメラマンのノートンさんは\n"
"　おそらく《巨像》を見に行ったのではないかとのこと。\n"
"　さっそく探しに行こう。"
msgstr ""

#. We found Norton right in front of the
#. statue. He didn't seem to be in danger,
#. though, so we let him stay for a while.
msgctxt "#152 step"
msgid ""
"・巨像前でノートンさんを発見。\n"
"　近くに魔獣の気配もないので、\n"
"　また改めて迎えに来ることに。"
msgstr ""

#. We brought Norton safely back to the
#. settlement, fulfilling the request.
msgctxt "#153 step"
msgid "・ノートンさんを集落に送り届け、依頼を達成した！"
msgstr ""

#. Wandering Sheep
msgctxt "#154 quest"
msgid "迷える羊の捜索"
msgstr ""

#. The fence in front of the pasture has
#. been damaged and a number of sheep have
#. gotten loose. Please help me find them.
#. 
#. I'll be in the pasture if you need more
#. details.
#.                            --Watari
msgctxt "#154 desc"
msgid ""
"柵が壊れ、羊が数匹\n"
"　逃げ出してしまったようだ。\n"
"\n"
"　できれば捜索を手伝って欲しい。\n"
"　詳しくは放牧場のワタリまで。\n"
"　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　──ワタリ"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・Watari says that the fence was damaged this
#. morning and five sheep have escaped.
#. ・Based on the hoofprints, it looks like three
#. are headed north, and the other two are headed
#. south. Let's get searching.
msgctxt "#155 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・ワタリさんによると昼前に柵が壊れ、\n"
"　羊たちが全部で５匹、逃げ出してしまったらしい。\n"
"・なお、足跡から判断するに、\n"
"　高原の北部に３匹、南部に２匹逃げたとのこと。\n"
"　さっそく連れ戻しに行こう。"
msgstr ""

#. We've found all five! We'd better get
#. back to Watari and let him know.
msgctxt "#156 step"
msgid ""
"・羊を５匹全て見つけた。\n"
"　集落に戻って、ワタリさんに報告しよう。"
msgstr ""

#. Sheep secured!
msgctxt "#157 step"
msgid "・ワタリさんに報告し、依頼を達成した！"
msgstr ""

#. A Special Lesson
msgctxt "#158 quest"
msgid "子供たちへの特別授業"
msgstr ""

#. I would like you to hold a simple lesson
#. for the children of this settlement in
#. order to broaden their horizons.
#. 
#. If you're willing to do so, please come
#. speak to me outside.
#.                          --Jedah
msgctxt "#158 desc"
msgid ""
"子供たちの見識を深めるために、\n"
"　簡単な授業を行ってやって欲しい。\n"
"\n"
"　外にいるから、\n"
"　よければ話を聞きに来ておくれ。\n"
"\n"
"　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　──ジェダ"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・I conducted a lesson about Erebonia
#. for the children of the settlement.
#. ・The last question really made me think,
#. but I had no trouble answering the others,
#. so the lesson went very smoothly.
msgctxt "#159 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・集落の子供たちに帝国に関する授業を行う。\n"
"・最後の質問には考えさせられたが……\n"
"　他はスムーズに答えることができ、\n"
"　無事に終えることができた。"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・I conducted a lesson about Erebonia
#. for the children of the settlement.
#. ・I had a bit of trouble with some
#. of the questions, but it was a decent
#. lesson regardless.
msgctxt "#160 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・集落の子供たちに帝国に関する授業を行う。\n"
"・少々もたついた所もあったが……\n"
"　とりあえず無事に終えることができた。"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・I conducted a lesson about Erebonia
#. for the children of the settlement.
#. ・I struggled through the whole thing and
#. ended up wasting everyone's time...but
#. I DID see it through to the end.
msgctxt "#161 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・集落の子供たちに帝国に関する授業を行う。\n"
"・もたつく所が多く、子供たちには申し訳なかったが……\n"
"　それでも何とか無事に終えることができた。"
msgstr ""

#. Connecting Hearts
msgctxt "#162 quest"
msgid "想いの架け橋"
msgstr ""

#. Sharl, a girl who works in the mess hall
#. at Zender Gate, asked us to find out
#. what Thoma's favorite color is.
#. 
#. It sounds like she wants to make him a
#. present, so we've got to ask him without
#. making him suspect anything.
msgctxt "#162 desc"
msgid ""
"ゼンダー門の食堂で働く少女・\n"
"　シャルの頼みで、トーマから好きな色を\n"
"　聞き出すことに。\n"
"\n"
"　どうやらプレゼント選びの\n"
"　参考にしたいようだが……\n"
"　トーマからそれとなく聞き出そう。"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・We managed to figure out Thoma's favorite
#. color in a discussion about clothes. Let's
#. tell Sharl a.s.a.p.!
msgctxt "#163 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・トーマと装束の話をする流れで好きな色について聞く。\n"
"　さっそくシャルに報告しよう。"
msgstr ""

#. We passed what Thoma told us on to Sharl.
msgctxt "#164 step"
msgid "・トーマと話した内容をシャルに伝えた！"
msgstr ""

#. Nord Highlands - North Monster
msgctxt "#165 quest"
msgid "ノルド高原・北部の手配魔獣"
msgstr ""

#. A large, unknown monster has been seen
#. around the northern part of the
#. highlands. It must be exterminated at
#. all costs.
#. 
#. Monster: Details unknown
#. Location: Southwest area of the northern
#. highlands, near a cliff edge.
#.                           --Lacan
msgctxt "#165 desc"
msgid ""
"高原の北部に、見たことのない\n"
"　大型魔獣が現れたようだ。\n"
"　お前たちにできれば討伐を頼みたい。\n"
"\n"
"　魔獣：詳細不明\n"
"　場所：ノルド高原北部・南西の崖付近\n"
"\n"
"　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　──ラカン"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・Monster down! We should tell Lacan,
#. just in case he couldn't hear it.
msgctxt "#166 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・手配魔獣を退治した！\n"
"　念のため、ラカンさんに報告しておこう。"
msgstr ""

#. We reported to Lacan, fulfilling
#. the request!
msgctxt "#167 step"
msgid "・ラカンさんに報告し、依頼を達成した！"
msgstr ""

#. Old Schoolhouse Mystery IV
msgctxt "#168 quest"
msgid "旧校舎地下の調査④"
msgstr ""

#. This month, I would like Class VII to
#. simply relax and enjoy themselves.
#. 
#. That, of course, was a joke. Please
#. delve deeper into the old schoolhouse
#. and report back to me.
#. 
#. You may begin when you are ready, but
#. be sure you're ready for anything.
#.                  --Principal Vandyck
msgctxt "#168 desc"
msgid ""
"先月に引き続き、旧校舎地下の調査を\n"
"　特科クラス《Ⅶ組》に依頼する。\n"
"\n"
"　かの場所で起きている\n"
"　多くの不可思議な現象について\n"
"　調べを進めてほしい。\n"
"\n"
"　万全に準備を整えた上で、\n"
"　諸君らの判断で始めてくれたまえ。\n"
"　　　　　　　　　　──ヴァンダイク学院長"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆ 
#. ・As we suspected, we're now able to access
#. the fourth floor. No sense in being too
#. hasty, though...
msgctxt "#169 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・やはりというべきか、\n"
"　新たに第４層に進めるようになっていた。\n"
"　慎重に進もう。"
msgstr ""

#. We encountered another monster deep within
#. the fourth floor, this one more powerful than
#. any before it. We managed to defeat it, but
#. we're all exhausted.
msgctxt "#170 step"
msgid ""
"・第４層の最奥にて、\n"
"　これまでにも増して強力な敵を倒す。\n"
"　そろそろ旧校舎を出よう。"
msgstr ""

#. That brings our fourth month of investigation
#. to a close.
msgctxt "#171 step"
msgid "・旧校舎の探索を無事に終えた！"
msgstr ""

#. Childhood Friend's Intentions
msgctxt "#172 quest"
msgid "幼馴染の本心"
msgstr ""

#. I've known this boy since we were kids,
#. but I have no idea what's on his mind
#. lately. To be honest, I'm a bit worried.
#. 
#. Would someone be able to give me some
#. advice on how to handle this? I'll be
#. in the upper class dormitory if you can
#. help.
#.              --Bridget, Year 1, Class II
msgctxt "#172 desc"
msgid ""
"幼馴染の男子生徒の気持ちが分からずに\n"
"　困っています。\n"
"\n"
"　どうか相談に乗って頂けないでしょうか。\n"
"　第一学生寮で待っています。\n"
"\n"
"　　　　　　　　　──１年Ⅱ組・ブリジット"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・I agreed to help Bridget find out how Alan
#. feels about her. He's in the Fencing Club,
#. so I'll look for him there.
msgctxt "#173 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・依頼を受け、フェンシング部の\n"
"　アランの気持ちを探ってみることに。\n"
"　まずは練武場を訪ねよう。"
msgstr ""

#. Alan wasn't in the training hall, but Loggins,
#. a second year, told me he might be on the field.
msgctxt "#174 step"
msgid ""
"・練武場にアランはいなかった。\n"
"　ロギンス先輩によると、多分グラウンドにいるらしい。"
msgstr ""

#. I found Alan training alone on the field and
#. suggested that we fight a Combat Shell together
#. a la Class VII's practical exams.
msgctxt "#175 step"
msgid ""
"・グラウンドで一人自主練習とするアランを見つけ、\n"
"　いつも《Ⅶ組》が行っている実技テストの要領で\n"
"　戦術殻との共闘を申し込む。"
msgstr ""

#. Alan regained his confidence after he landed
#. the final blow on the Combat Shell. Better yet,
#. he told me how he feels about Bridget...
#. He can handle things from here.
msgctxt "#176 step"
msgid ""
"・──アランがトドメを指したことで\n"
"　自信を取り戻してくれたようだ。\n"
"　本音も聞けたことだし、後は本人に任せよう。"
msgstr ""

#. Alan regained his confidence after an
#. impressive fight against the Combat Shell.
#. Better yet, he told me how he feels about
#. Bridget... He can handle things from here.
msgctxt "#177 step"
msgid ""
"・──何とか善戦することで、\n"
"　自信を取り戻してくれたようだ。\n"
"　本音も聞けたことだし、後は本人に任せよう。"
msgstr ""

#. The battle didn't go the way I'd hoped, but it
#. seemed to cheer Alan up anyway. Afterwards he
#. told me how he feels about Bridget...
#. He can handle things from here.
msgctxt "#178 step"
msgid ""
"・──結果はいまいちだったが、\n"
"　それでも少しは気を紛れたようだ。\n"
"　本音も聞けたことだし、後は本人に任せよう。"
msgstr ""

#. Snapped
msgctxt "#179 quest"
msgid "隠し撮り写真の摘発"
msgstr ""

#. Rumor has it that a first year in the
#. Photography Club who shall remain
#. nameless (Rex) has been taking pictures
#. of people without their permission and
#. selling them to other students.
#. 
#. If this is true. I need to make him stop
#. for his own good (and everyone else's).
#. If you are willing to assist me, please
#. come to the Photography Club's clubroom.
#.              --Fidelio, Year 2, Class II
msgctxt "#179 desc"
msgid ""
"最近、写真部の後輩のレックスが\n"
"　よからぬ隠し撮り写真を使い、\n"
"　何やら取り引きを行っているらしい。\n"
"\n"
"　この話が本当なら、本人のためにも\n"
"　やめさせなくてはならないが……\n"
"　どうかそのための協力をお願いしたい。\n"
"　まずは写真部室まで。\n"
"　　　　　　　　　──２年Ⅱ組・フィデリオ"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・After a bit of discussion, Fidelio and I
#. decided it would be best to catch Rex in the act.
#. ・He told me that Rex exchanges his wares near
#. the old schoolhouse and behind the field's
#. storage building. I'm going to check them out.
msgctxt "#180 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・フィデリオ先輩から話を伺い、\n"
"　何とかして取り引きの現場を押さえることに。\n"
"・グラウンドの体育倉庫裏と旧校舎方面、\n"
"　まずはどちらかを調べてみよう。"
msgstr ""

#. I found Rex behind the storage building,
#. but he ran off before I could confront him.
#. Time to head to the old schoolhouse.
msgctxt "#181 step"
msgid ""
"・体育倉庫裏でレックスを見つけたが、\n"
"　気配を察知され、逃げられてしまった……\n"
"　次は旧校舎方面を探ろう。"
msgstr ""

#. I tried to be careful, but I fell right
#. into Rex's trap. He got away again...
#. ・I'm sure he's hidden somewhere without too
#. many people, but I have no idea where...
#. Guess I'll have to start looking around.
msgctxt "#182 step"
msgid ""
"・今度は警戒しつつもレックスの策にはまり、\n"
"　再び逃げられてしまった……\n"
"・他に人目につかなそうな場所……\n"
"　とりあえず調べてみよう。"
msgstr ""

#. I found Rex inside the auditorium.
#. Surprise, surprise -- he ran away again,
#. but I can tell he's still in the building.
msgctxt "#183 step"
msgid ""
"・講堂にてレックスを発見──\n"
"　まだ気配があるので近くにいるはずだ。"
msgstr ""

#. I managed to corner Rex and dragged him back
#. to Fidelio. At least it seems like he's
#. reflecting on what he did wrong...
msgctxt "#184 step"
msgid ""
"・レックスを追い詰め、フィデリオ先輩の元へ連れて行く。\n"
"　一応、彼なりに反省はしてくれたようだ。"
msgstr ""

#. Swimming Lessons
msgctxt "#185 quest"
msgid "水練の稽古"
msgstr ""

#. At Instructor Neithardt's suggestion, I
#. rounded up the other guys in Class VII
#. for his special swimming lessons.
#. 
#. He says he's going to teach us the most
#. effective and manly way to swim...
#. I have no idea what he's talking about.
msgctxt "#185 desc"
msgid ""
"ナイトハルト教官の提案により、\n"
"　Ⅶ組の男子全員、\n"
"　水練の稽古を付けてもらうことに。\n"
"\n"
"　何でも教官が、\n"
"　コツを教えてくれるそうだが……"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・We started by racing each other.
#. I chose Elliot as my first opponent.
msgctxt "#186 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・とりあえず競争から始めることになり、\n"
"　最初はエリオットと泳ぐことに。"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・We started by racing each other.
#. I chose Machias as my first opponent.
msgctxt "#187 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・とりあえず競争から始めることになり、\n"
"　最初はマキアスと泳ぐことに。"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・We started by racing each other.
#. I chose Jusis as my first opponent.
msgctxt "#188 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・とりあえず競争から始めることになり、\n"
"　最初はユーシスと泳ぐことに。"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・We started by racing each other.
#. I chose Gaius as my first opponent.
msgctxt "#189 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・とりあえず競争から始めることになり、\n"
"　最初はガイウスと泳ぐことに。"
msgstr ""

#. I won against him, too.
msgctxt "#190 step"
msgid "結果──勝つことができた。"
msgstr ""

#. I lost against him, though...
msgctxt "#191 step"
msgid "結果──負けてしまった。"
msgstr ""

#. After that, Neithardt had us swim until
#. we couldn't swim anymore... He is not a
#. merciful man.
#. ・He is an effective one, though. We're
#. all posting way better times than we
#. were before.
msgctxt "#192 step"
msgid ""
"・その後、体力の限界まで泳がされた俺たちは\n"
"　ナイトハルト教官の厳しさを痛感……\n"
"・だが訓練の内容は確かで、成果を実感することができた！"
msgstr ""

#. A Brush with Destiny
msgctxt "#193 quest"
msgid "東方風の筆"
msgstr ""

#. Gyler the janitor found a really nice
#. Eastern ink brush and asked me to help
#. him find its rightful owner.
#. 
#. My old master enjoyed calligraphy, so
#. I have the feeling that I know who this
#. brush belongs to. I should ask them.
msgctxt "#193 desc"
msgid ""
"水場で拾ったという\n"
"　立派な東方風の筆を預かり、\n"
"　持ち主を探してみることに。\n"
"\n"
"　俺の師匠・ユン老師も\n"
"　筆を使った《書》を嗜むが……\n"
"　心当たりの人物を訪ねてみよう。"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・My feeling was correct. The brush was
#. Principal Vandyck's. I'm curious as to how
#. he came to befriend my master...but for
#. now, I'm just glad he has his brush back.
msgctxt "#194 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・筆の持ち主は何と、ヴァンダイク学院長だった。\n"
"　旧い友人というのが若干気になるが……\n"
"　とりあえず持ち主が見つかってよかった。"
msgstr ""

#. Underground Passage Monster
msgctxt "#195 quest"
msgid "帝都地下道の手配魔獣"
msgstr ""

#. My name is Noble. I run the Der Himmel
#. hotel which, unfortunately, currently
#. has a monster lurking beneath it.
#. 
#. If you can get rid of it, please see me
#. at my hotel in the Garnier District.
#.                           --Noble
msgctxt "#195 desc"
msgid ""
"ホテルの地下に生息する大型魔獣の退治を\n"
"お願いします。\n"
"\n"
"詳しくは、ガルニエ地区にある\n"
"ホテル《デア＝ヒンメル》の\n"
"支配人・ノーブルまで。\n"
"　　　　　　　　　　　　　　──ノーブル"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・We visited Noble's hotel, but he seemed
#. to be away. We'll have to check again
#. when we're finished with our other obligations.
msgctxt "#196 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・ノーブル支配人はどうやら留守らしい。\n"
"　他の依頼を片付けてからまた来よう。"
msgstr ""

#. Noble gave us the key to the passage
#. under the hotel. We should take care
#. of this quickly, but preparedly.
msgctxt "#197 step"
msgid ""
"・ノーブル支配人から地下道の鍵を受け取った。\n"
"　準備を整えて向かおう。"
msgstr ""

#. Target eliminated. Let's go back to
#. the hotel and give Noble our report.
msgctxt "#198 step"
msgid ""
"・手配魔獣を退治した！\n"
"　ホテルへ戻って報告しよう。"
msgstr ""

#. We gave our report at the hotel,
#. completing yet another request.
msgctxt "#199 step"
msgid "・ホテルに報告、依頼を達成した！"
msgstr ""

#. Hat's Off
msgctxt "#200 quest"
msgid "手作り帽子の落し物"
msgstr ""

#. A customer who visited my gelato
#. stall yesterday accidentally dropped
#. their hat.
#. 
#. I'd like to get it back to them, but
#. I'm not sure how. If you have any good
#. ideas, please visit my stall in
#. Dreichels Plaza.
#.                          --Jasmine
msgctxt "#200 desc"
msgid ""
"先日、ウチのアイス屋にいらっしゃった\n"
"　お客様が帽子を落されていきました。\n"
"\n"
"　何とかお返ししたいのですが……\n"
"　まずはドライケルス広場にある\n"
"　当店にて話を聞いて頂けますでしょうか。\n"
"　　　　　　　　　　　　　　──ジャスミン"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・Jasmine left the hat in our care and
#. we agreed to search for its owner.
#. ・She says he's from the Ost District.
#. We'll start our search at Gamgee's pub,
#. since Machias knows the man who runs it.
msgctxt "#201 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・ジャスミンさんから帽子を預かり、\n"
"　持ち主を探し出して届けることに。\n"
"・オスト地区出身の男性とのことで、\n"
"　まずはマキアスの知る居酒屋《ギャムジー》で\n"
"　話を聞いてみることに。"
msgstr ""

#. We spoke with Gamgee, who shed some
#. light on the hat's owner.
#. ・His name is Jim and he lives in a house
#. near the pub. All we have to do is leave
#. the pub, take a slight right, and follow
#. the steps down. Piece of cake.
msgctxt "#202 step"
msgid ""
"・居酒屋の店主・ギャムジーさんに話を聞くと、　\n"
"　持ち主が判明。\n"
"・店の右斜め方向にある家に住んでいる\n"
"　ジムさんとのこと。"
msgstr ""

#. We visited Jim's home, but his wife
#. informed us that he had stepped out.
#. ・He apparently just left, so he shouldn't
#. have gone too far from home yet...
msgctxt "#203 step"
msgid ""
"・ジムさんの家を訪ねると、\n"
"　本人は不在で奥さんから話を聞く。\n"
"・つい先ほどまで家にいたらしいが……\n"
"　とりあえず近くを探そう。"
msgstr ""

#. We found Jim at the tram stop. Just as
#. we were returning his hat, his wife showed
#. up and they both thanked us.
#. ・We've let Jasmine know that the hat
#. situation has been sorted out!
msgctxt "#204 step"
msgid ""
"・停留所でトラムを待つジムさんに遭遇。\n"
"　その場で帽子を渡すと、奥さんが現れ\n"
"　二人からお礼を言われる。\n"
"・ジャスミンさんにも報告し、依頼を達成した！"
msgstr ""

#. Chronicles of the Chronicle
msgctxt "#205 quest"
msgid "夏至祭関連取材の手伝い"
msgstr ""

#. A journalist at the Imperial Chronicle
#. needs assistance with a tourism piece
#. he's preparing.
#. 
#. For more information, speak to me at
#. reception in our office on Vainqueur
#. Street and I will connect you two.
#.                         --Citron
msgctxt "#205 desc"
msgid ""
"夏至祭に関連する取材で、\n"
"　お手伝いしていただきたいことがあります。\n"
"\n"
"　詳しいことは担当の者が説明致しますので\n"
"　まずはヴァンクール通りにある\n"
"　帝国時報社・受付まで。\n"
"　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　──シトロン"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・Norton explained that he's producing a
#. tourist brochure for the Summer Festival
#. and asked us to get photos of and a
#. comment from every store in the district.
#. ・There are five places we need to visit:
#. 1) Weston House, in Plaza Bifrost
#. 2) Mimosa, in Plaza Bifrost
#. 3) Watson's Weapons & Armor
#. 4) Lumiere Orbal Factory
#. 5) Le Sage Boutique
msgctxt "#206 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・ノートンさんから説明を受け、観光案内の\n"
"　パンフレットに使うコメントを各店舗から回収しつつ、\n"
"　ついでにそのお店の写真を撮ってくることに。\n"
"・場所は全部で５件──\n"
"　①百貨店：総合食材《ウェストンハウス》\n"
"　②百貨店：喫茶コーナー《ミモザ》\n"
"　③《ワトソン武器商会》\n"
"　④《リュミエール工房》\n"
"　⑤ブティック《ル・サージュ》"
msgstr ""

#. Received a comment from Weston House!
msgctxt "#207 step"
msgid ""
"・総合食材《ウェストンハウス》の一言ＰＲを受け取り、\n"
"　写真撮影を行った。"
msgstr ""

#. Received a comment from Mimosa!
msgctxt "#208 step"
msgid ""
"・喫茶コーナー《ミモザ》の一言ＰＲを受け取り、\n"
"　写真撮影を行った。"
msgstr ""

#. Received a comment from
#. Watson's Weapons & Armor!
msgctxt "#209 step"
msgid ""
"・《ワトソン武器商会》の一言ＰＲを受け取り、\n"
"　写真撮影を行った。"
msgstr ""

#. Received a comment from
#. Lumiere Orbal Factory!
msgctxt "#210 step"
msgid ""
"・《リュミエール工房》の一言ＰＲを受け取り、\n"
"　写真撮影を行った。"
msgstr ""

#. Received a comment from
#. Le Sage Boutique!
msgctxt "#211 step"
msgid ""
"・ブティック《ル・サージュ》の一言ＰＲを受け取り、\n"
"　写真撮影を行った。"
msgstr ""

#. We've got everything we need from all five
#. stores. Let's get back to Norton in the
#. Imperial Chronicle building.
msgctxt "#212 step"
msgid ""
"・全５箇所の店舗を一通り回った。\n"
"　帝国時報社へ報告に戻ろう。"
msgstr ""

#. We gave Norton all of the comments
#. and photos from each store.
msgctxt "#213 step"
msgid "・ノートンさんに報告し、依頼を達成した！"
msgstr ""

#. Amber Amour
msgctxt "#214 quest"
msgid "琥珀の愛"
msgstr ""

#. One of my cafe's most popular records
#. has been shattered.
#. 
#. If possible, I'd like to get another
#. record of the same song, but I need
#. help. Visit me at the Concert Cafe - 
#. Etoile on Alto Street for further
#. information.
#.                         --Heming
msgctxt "#214 desc"
msgid ""
"店でかけている定番のレコードが\n"
"　割れてしまった。\n"
"\n"
"　何とかして同じ物を手に入れたいのだが……\n"
"　どうか力を貸して欲しい。\n"
"　詳しくは、アルト通りの\n"
"　音楽喫茶《エトワール》まで。\n"
"　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　──ヘミング"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・The smashed record was a thirty-year-old
#. song named 'Amber Amour.'
#. ・We thought that Fiona might know something,
#. so we went over to Elliot's house.
msgctxt "#215 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・割れたレコードは『琥珀の愛』という、\n"
"　３０年以上前に出た曲とのこと。\n"
"・まずはエリオットの実家の\n"
"　フィオナさんに話を聞きに行こう。"
msgstr ""

#. Fiona suggested that we ask at the
#. reception desk in Plaza Bifrost.
#. That's on Vainqueur Street.
msgctxt "#216 step"
msgid ""
"・フィオナさんに話を聞くと、ヴァンクール大通りにある\n"
"　百貨店《プラザ・ビフロスト》の\n"
"　受付に問い合わせてみたらどうかと助言をもらう。"
msgstr ""

#. The receptionist at Plaza Bifrost told us
#. that the record was sold out everywhere and
#. that the only way to secure a copy would be
#. to order it directly from the manufacturer. Yikes.
#. ・But she did tell us to check out Emmrod's,
#. a secondhand store in the Ost District.
#. We might luck out and find it there.
msgctxt "#217 step"
msgid ""
"・百貨店に問い合わせたが、どこも品切れ状態らしく\n"
"　メーカーに直接注文するしかないとのこと。\n"
"・受付の方からオスト地区にある中古屋\n"
"　《エムロッド》を覗いてみてはどうかと助言をもらう。\n"
"　さっそく行ってみよう。"
msgstr ""

#. We finally managed to get our hands on
#. a used copy of 'Amber Amour.' Let's get
#. it back to Heming as soon as we can.
msgctxt "#218 step"
msgid ""
"・中古屋で目的のレコードを手に入れた。\n"
"　ヘミングさんに届けよう。"
msgstr ""

#. We gave Heming his record, and Etoile
#. finally has its signature song back!
msgctxt "#219 step"
msgid "・ヘミングさんにレコードを渡し、依頼を達成した！"
msgstr ""

#. Heimdallr Port Monster
msgctxt "#220 quest"
msgid "ヘイムダル港の手配魔獣"
msgstr ""

#. A terrifying monster has been sighted
#. in an underground waterway near
#. Heimdallr port.
#. 
#. Confirm the specifics with Danberto the
#. port chief, then eliminate the creature.
msgctxt "#220 desc"
msgid ""
"ヘイムダル港付近の地下水道に\n"
"　危険な大型魔獣が出現したとの報告あり。\n"
"\n"
"　まずはヘイムダル港に向かい、\n"
"　管理長のダンベルト氏に詳細を要確認。\n"
"　その上で、魔獣討伐を行うこと。"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・We took the key to the underground
#. waterway from Danberto. We can get in
#. through a door farther into the port.
msgctxt "#221 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・ダンベルトさんから地下水道の鍵を受け取った。\n"
"　奥にある扉から入れるらしい。"
msgstr ""

#. The waterways are safe once again!
#. Let's get out of here and tell Danberto.
msgctxt "#222 step"
msgid ""
"・手配魔獣を退治した！\n"
"　地下水道を出て報告しよう。"
msgstr ""

#. We told Danberto that we
#. defeated the monster!
msgctxt "#223 step"
msgid "・ダンベルトさんに報告し、依頼を達成した！"
msgstr ""

#. Made for Walkin'
msgctxt "#224 quest"
msgid "新製品のテスト"
msgstr ""

#. I need someone to test a new product.
#. 
#. Come to Le Sage on Vainqueur Street
#. and I'll tell you more.
#.                          --Howard
msgctxt "#224 desc"
msgid ""
"とある新製品のテストを行ってもらいたい。\n"
"\n"
"詳しくはヴァンクール通りの\n"
"ブティック《ル・サージュ》まで。\n"
"　　　　　　　　　　　　　　──ハワード"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・Howard gave us a pair of Ladies' Stregas.
#. ・Laura's going to have to walk two
#. thousand steps while wearing them.
msgctxt "#225 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・ハワード・オーナーから\n"
"　『ストレガー・レディ』を受け取った。\n"
"・ラウラに履いてもらい、２０００歩以上歩こう。"
msgstr ""

#. Laura walked over two thousand steps in the
#. Stregas and we told Howard how they held up.
msgctxt "#226 step"
msgid ""
"・２０００歩以上歩き、ハワード・オーナーに報告。\n"
"　依頼を達成した！"
msgstr ""

#. Oh No, Nono!
msgctxt "#227 quest"
msgid "迷い猫の捜索"
msgstr ""

#. Our family's kitten has gone missing.
#. 
#. If you can help us, please visit us in our
#. home in the Ost District for more details.
#.                          --Keaton
msgctxt "#227 desc"
msgid ""
"我が家の大切な子猫を探しています。\n"
"　\n"
"　まずは話を聞きに、オスト地区の自宅まで\n"
"　来てもらえないでしょうか。\n"
"　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　──キートン"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・Keaton's family told us all about their
#. missing kitten, Nono. She has white fur and is
#. very timid... She shouldn't have strayed too far.
#. ・The family's already asked the residents'
#. association to help them search indoors, so we
#. only need to look outdoors in the Ost District.
msgctxt "#228 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・キートンさん一家から事情を伺う。\n"
"　迷子になったのは白い子猫のノノ。\n"
"　とても臆病な子らしく、迷子とはいえ\n"
"　そう遠くへは行っていないだろうとのこと。\n"
"・自治会にも依頼しているため、\n"
"　屋内にいれば連絡が入るだろうということで、\n"
"　オスト地区の屋外を一通り探すことに。"
msgstr ""

#. We spotted two brown cats -- a mother and a
#. kitten -- in northern Ost.
msgctxt "#229 step"
msgid "・オスト地区の北で茶色の親子猫を見かけた。"
msgstr ""

#. We spotted a black and white cat in
#. southern Ost.
msgctxt "#230 step"
msgid "・オスト地区の南で牛柄模様の猫を見かけた。"
msgstr ""

#. We spotted a gray cat in eastern Ost.
msgctxt "#231 step"
msgid "・オスト地区の東でグレーの猫を見かけた。"
msgstr ""

#. We spotted Mr. Tiddles, the leader
#. of all the cats in Ost. Let's go
#. after him and see what we find!
msgctxt "#232 step"
msgid ""
"・オスト地区の東でボス猫の『ボス』を見かけた。\n"
"　後を追おう。"
msgstr ""

#. Yes! We brought Nono back!
msgctxt "#233 step"
msgid "・ノノを無事に発見、依頼を達成した！"
msgstr ""

#. Burglary at the Jewelers
msgctxt "#234 quest"
msgid "宝飾店の盗難事件"
msgstr ""

#. It seems a burglary has taken place at
#. a jewelers in the Garnier District
#. called San Corries.
#. 
#. We should head over and find out what
#. happened as soon as possible!
msgctxt "#234 desc"
msgid ""
"ガルニエ地区にある宝飾店にて、\n"
"　盗難事件が発生した模様。\n"
"　\n"
"　店の名前は《サン・コリーズ》──　\n"
"　すぐに向かって、責任者から話を聞こう。"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・The owner, Cordelia, told us that the culprit
#. was the famous Phantom Thief B, and that he'd
#. specifically called us out for some sort of
#. treasure hunt.
#. ・While it feels like we're walking into a trap,
#. if we can get the stolen Crimson Tiara back, we
#. need to try. Our first clue: 'At the feet of
#. the conqueror with the heart of a lion.'
msgctxt "#235 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・コーデリア店長から事件の概要を聞く。\n"
"　犯人は帝都で知られる盗賊《怪盗Ｂ》──\n"
"　なぜか俺たちⅦ組Ａ班に\n"
"　試練と称して宝探しの真似事をさせたいらしい。\n"
"・とにかく、盗まれた《紅蓮の小冠》を取り戻そう。\n"
"　ヒントは──\n"
"　『獅子の心を持つ覇者　\n"
"　　その足元を見よ』"
msgstr ""

#. We found our next card at the feet of the
#. statue of Emperor Dreichels in Dreichels Plaza.
#. On it was another clue, reading 'In the
#. northeastern seat of the prismatic palace.'
msgctxt "#236 step"
msgid ""
"・ドライケルス広場にて、\n"
"　ドライケルス大帝の足元に貼られたカードを発見。\n"
"　そこには次のヒントが──\n"
"　『光透ける箱庭の中　\n"
"　　北東の座に』"
msgstr ""

#. We found another card attached to the
#. northeast bench in the Crystal Garden. Our next
#. clue: 'At the round table where once rested the
#. gauntlets that supported the east of the city.'
#. ・Right after that, we ran into Baron Bleublanc.
#. I don't know what he's after, but he gives me
#. a weird feeling...
msgctxt "#237 step"
msgid ""
"・クリスタルガーデンにて、\n"
"　北東のベンチに貼られたカードを発見。\n"
"　次のヒントは──\n"
"　『かつて都の東を支えた籠手たち　\n"
"　　彼らが憩いし円卓に』\n"
"・なおその際、ブルブラン男爵と遭遇。\n"
"　相変わらず何が目的なのか分からないが……"
msgstr ""

#. We found another card, this one attached to
#. the legs of the table on the second floor of the
#. guild where we were staying. Its clue says:
#. 'On the bottom of the white burden of the steel
#. bird perched at the water's edge.'
msgctxt "#238 step"
msgid ""
"・俺たちの宿泊先であるアルト通りの旧ギルド支部、\n"
"　その２階のテーブルの足元に貼られたカードを発見。\n"
"　次のヒントは──\n"
"　『水際にて佇む鋼鉄の鳥\n"
"　　その身に課せられた \n"
"　　白き重荷の裏に』"
msgstr ""

#. We headed to Heimdallr Port and asked the
#. chief there to check the bottom of the
#. containers near the large crane. Lo and behold,
#. we found another card.
#. ・The seemingly-final clue also appears to
#. point to Heimdallr Port: 'The crimson crown
#. you seek sleeps within a black ark, nestled
#. in the steel car that marches with the minutes.'
msgctxt "#239 step"
msgid ""
"・ヘイムダル港にて、管理長さんにお願いし、\n"
"　大型クレーンの脇にあるコンテナの底を調べると\n"
"　何とカードが貼られていた。\n"
"・次の指定は同じヘイムダル港の模様。\n"
"　どうやら今度で最後のようだが……\n"
"　『待ち合わせに赴いた\n"
"　　長き鋼鉄の車\n"
"　　深紅の宝はその中で眠る\n"
"　　黒き匣に包まれて』"
msgstr ""

#. The driver agreed to let us look inside the tram.
msgctxt "#240 step"
msgid "・運転士さんにお願いし、導力トラムの中を探すことに。"
msgstr ""

#. We safely recovered the Crimson Tiara
#. from inside the tram.
#. ・We then learned that the driver we spoke
#. to was the Phantom Thief B -- or Bleublanc,
#. as he introduced himself -- in disguise. We
#. still don't know what he's after, though.
#. ・Even though we couldn't capture him, we
#. were able to recover the tiara. We checked
#. in with the local government and reported
#. back to Cordelia at San Corries.
msgctxt "#241 step"
msgid ""
"・導力トラムの中で無事に《紅蓮の小冠》を取り戻す。\n"
"・なお《怪盗Ｂ》は運転士に変装し、\n"
"　大胆にも俺たちとの接触を図った。\n"
"　バリアハートでも会ったブルブラン男爵──\n"
"　改めて『怪盗紳士ブルブラン』と名乗ったが、\n"
"　その目的はやはり分からない。\n"
"・怪盗を捕まえることは出来なかったが、\n"
"　事件のあらましを帝都庁に伝え、宝飾店の店長に報告。\n"
"　何とか無事に依頼を達成した。"
msgstr ""

#. In Case of Emergency
msgctxt "#242 quest"
msgid "取り違えられた荷物"
msgstr ""

#. A tourist from Crossbell by the name of
#. Bond seems to have swapped suitcases
#. with someone else by mistake.
#. 
#. Let's see if we can find whoever that
#. was and get this mixup sorted out.
msgctxt "#242 desc"
msgid ""
"クロスベルから来たという\n"
"　ボンドさんの荷物を間違えて\n"
"　持っていってしまった人がいるらしい。\n"
"　\n"
"　何とか、その人物を探し出し、\n"
"　お互いの荷物を元に戻してあげよう。"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・Apparently the person who has Bond's
#. briefcase has plans to watch the parade
#. from the Garnier District. Let's move.
msgctxt "#243 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・もう一方の荷物の持ち主は、\n"
"　ガルニエ地区でパレードを見る予定のようだ。\n"
"　通りで詳しそうな人に聞いてみよう。"
msgstr ""

#. We talked to a man running a juice stall in
#. the Garnier District and he told us that the
#. person we're looking for was looking for a
#. place to rest, so he recommended the Alto
#. District. Let's see if he's at Concert
#. Cafe - Etoile.
msgctxt "#244 step"
msgid ""
"・ガルニエ地区のジュース屋さんに\n"
"　荷物の持ち主の心当りを聞く。\n"
"　手頃に休める場所を聞かれ、\n"
"　アルト通りを勧めたそうだが……\n"
"　音楽喫茶《エトワール》を覗いてみよう。"
msgstr ""

#. We found the man with Bond's briefcase
#. and solved the suitcase situation!
msgctxt "#245 step"
msgid ""
"・荷物の持ち主を発見し、\n"
"　ボンドさんの荷物と無事に交換してもらった！"
msgstr ""

#. Old Schoolhouse Mystery V
msgctxt "#246 quest"
msgid "旧校舎地下の調査⑤"
msgstr ""

#. Does anyone in Class VII actually read
#. these? If I wrote whatever I wanted
#. here, would they investigate the old
#. schoolhouse regardless? Perhaps I should
#. use this opportunity to tell a joke.
#. 
#. I know just the one! Two men walk into a
#. bar, Instructors Neithardt and Thomas,
#. perhaps, and one says to the other --
#. Oh, blast it, I'm out of room...
#.                  --Principal Vandyck
msgctxt "#246 desc"
msgid ""
"先月に引き続き、旧校舎地下の調査を\n"
"　特科クラス《Ⅶ組》に依頼する。\n"
"　\n"
"　かの場所で起きている\n"
"　多くの不可思議な現象について\n"
"　調べを進めてほしい。\n"
"　\n"
"　万全に準備を整えた上で、\n"
"　諸君らの判断で始めてくれたまえ。\n"
"　　　　　　　　　　──ヴァンダイク学院長"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・We can now go all the way down to the fifth
#. floor of the schoolhouse. What kind of horrors
#. could await us down there?
msgctxt "#247 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・新たな階層、第５層に辿り着いた。\n"
"　慎重に調査を開始しよう。"
msgstr ""

#. Oh, that kind. We defeated another tough
#. enemy on the fifth floor. That's enough
#. exploration for me for one day.
msgctxt "#248 step"
msgid ""
"・第５層の最奥にて、強力な敵を倒す。\n"
"　そろそろ旧校舎を出よう。"
msgstr ""

#. Another month, another floor investigated.
msgctxt "#249 step"
msgid "・旧校舎の探索を無事に終えた！"
msgstr ""

#. Side by Sidecar
msgctxt "#250 quest"
msgid "導力バイクの機能拡張"
msgstr ""

#. We're adding a new feature to the bike
#. and we want YOU to give it a test run.
#. 
#. Come see us in the engineering building
#. when you're ready to ride.
#.                     --George & Angelica
msgctxt "#250 desc"
msgid ""
"機能拡張のため、あるユニットを取り付けた\n"
"　導力バイクの走行テストを頼みたい。\n"
"　\n"
"　詳しくは、技術部棟まで。\n"
"　　　　　　　　──ジョルジュ＆アンゼリカ"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・Today I'll be testing something called
#. a 'sidecar,' which means I'll have Towa
#. riding next to me through the whole test.
#. ・It took some getting used to, but I
#. think I handled the sidecar pretty well!
msgctxt "#251 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・今回は《サイドカー》の運転ということで、\n"
"　隣にトワ会長を乗せた状態で各種項目をテスト──\n"
"・独特の挙動に戸惑いつつも、\n"
"　我ながら上手く操縦することができた！"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・Today I'll be testing something called
#. a 'sidecar,' which means I'll have Towa
#. riding next to me through the whole test.
#. ・It took some getting used to, but I
#. think I handled the sidecar well enough.
msgctxt "#252 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・今回は《サイドカー》の運転ということで、\n"
"　隣にトワ会長を乗せた状態で各種項目をテスト──\n"
"・独特の挙動に戸惑いつつも、\n"
"　それなりに上手く操縦することができた。"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・Today I'll be testing something called
#. a 'sidecar,' which means I'll have Towa
#. riding next to me through the whole test.
#. ・Yikes, that was a rough ride. I don't
#. think I can count all the mistakes I made.
msgctxt "#253 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・今回は《サイドカー》の運転ということで、\n"
"　隣にトワ会長を乗せた状態で各種項目をテスト──\n"
"・独特の挙動に戸惑い、かなりミスしてしまった……"
msgstr ""

#. Thors' 7 Mysteries
msgctxt "#254 quest"
msgid "学院七不思議の調査"
msgstr ""

#. Lately, the other girls have been going
#. on about the seven mysteries of the
#. academy. I desire this grim knowledge.
#. 
#. If you do, too, visit the Occult
#. Research Society clubroom in the Student
#. Union building.
#.             --Beryl, Year 1, Class III
msgctxt "#254 desc"
msgid ""
"最近、一部の女子の間で流行っている\n"
"　学院七不思議の調査をお願いしたいの。\n"
"　\n"
"　詳しくは学生会館・オカルト研究会まで。\n"
"　\n"
"　　　　　　　　　　　──１年Ⅲ組・ベリル"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・I agreed to ask people who might be
#. familiar with the mysteries for more
#. details. If there's anything that I'm
#. not sure about, I should ask Beryl.
msgctxt "#255 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・七不思議について、それぞれ詳しそうな人に\n"
"　話を聞きに行くことに。\n"
"　分からないことがあれば、ベリルに聞こう。"
msgstr ""

#. The first mystery is 'The Crying
#. Sculpture.' Clara runs the Art Club,
#. so she might know the truth behind it.
msgctxt "#256 step"
msgid ""
"・一つ目の不思議は『彫像の涙』。\n"
"　美術部のクララ先輩から話を聞こう。"
msgstr ""

#. The second mystery is 'The Haunted
#. Piano.' This one's a question for
#. Hibelle, head of the Wind Orchestra.
msgctxt "#257 step"
msgid ""
"・二つ目の不思議は『無人の演奏会』。\n"
"　吹奏楽部のハイベル先輩から話を聞こう。"
msgstr ""

#. The third mystery is 'The Forbidden
#. Tome.' Nobody knows books like Instructor
#. Thomas, so I should ask him about it.
msgctxt "#258 step"
msgid ""
"・三つ目の不思議は『禁断の書』。\n"
"　トマス教官から話を聞こう。"
msgstr ""

#. The fourth mystery is 'The Hidden
#. Graves.' Paula spends a lot of time on the
#. field riding horses, so we should talk.
msgctxt "#259 step"
msgid ""
"・四つ目の不思議は『グラウンドの墓穴』。\n"
"　馬術部のポーラさんから話を聞こう。"
msgstr ""

#. The fifth mystery is 'The Sports Clubs'
#. Grudge.' Friedel's the Fencing Club
#. captain; she probably knows her screams...
msgctxt "#260 step"
msgid ""
"・五つ目の不思議は『練武場の悲鳴』。\n"
"　フェンシング部のフリーデル先輩から話を聞こう。"
msgstr ""

#. The sixth mystery is 'The Crimson Devil
#. of Lake Hell.' Kenneth's the guy to ask.
#. His last name IS Lakelord, after all.
msgctxt "#261 step"
msgid ""
"・六つ目の不思議は『地獄池の赤い悪魔』。\n"
"　釣皇倶楽部のケネスから話を聞こう。"
msgstr ""

#. The seventh mystery is 'The Poltergeist
#. in the Upper Class Dormitory.' The maids
#. are there all day, so I should ask them.
msgctxt "#262 step"
msgid ""
"・七つ目の不思議は『ポルターガイスト』。\n"
"　第一学生寮のメイドさんから話を聞こう。"
msgstr ""

#. Clara gave me some information
#. on 'The Crying Sculpture.'
msgctxt "#263 step"
msgid ""
"・『彫像の涙』について、\n"
"　美術部のクララ先輩から情報を得た。"
msgstr ""

#. Hibelle gave me some information
#. on 'The Haunted Piano.'
msgctxt "#264 step"
msgid ""
"・『無人の演奏会』について、\n"
"　吹奏楽部のハイベル先輩から情報を得た。"
msgstr ""

#. Instructor Thomas gave me some
#. information on 'The Forbidden Tome.'
msgctxt "#265 step"
msgid ""
"・『禁断の書』について、\n"
"　トマス教官から情報を得た。"
msgstr ""

#. Paula gave me some information
#. on 'The Hidden Graves.'
msgctxt "#266 step"
msgid ""
"・『グラウンドの墓穴』について、\n"
"　馬術部のポーラから情報を得た。"
msgstr ""

#. Friedel gave me some information
#. on 'The Sports Clubs' Grudge.'
msgctxt "#267 step"
msgid ""
"・『練武場の悲鳴』について、\n"
"　フェンシング部のフリーデル先輩から情報を得た。"
msgstr ""

#. Kenneth gave me some information
#. on 'The Crimson Devil of Lake Hell.'
msgctxt "#268 step"
msgid ""
"・『地獄池の赤い悪魔』について、\n"
"　ケネスから情報を得た。"
msgstr ""

#. Lotte have me some information on 'The
#. Poltergeist in the Upper Class Dormitory.'
msgctxt "#269 step"
msgid ""
"・『ポルターガイスト』について、\n"
"　ロッテさんから情報を得た。"
msgstr ""

#. I've gathered information on all seven
#. mysteries. I should go tell Beryl everything
#. I know.
msgctxt "#270 step"
msgid ""
"・七不思議に関する情報を一通り入手した。\n"
"　ベリルに報告しに行こう。"
msgstr ""

#. I gave Beryl all the information I'd gathered.
#. I'm curious what she meant by 'the real seven
#. mysteries,' but it's probably safer if I don't
#. even ask...
msgctxt "#271 step"
msgid ""
"・ベリルに調査結果を報告して依頼を達成。\n"
"　“本物の七不思議”については気になるが……\n"
"　とりあえず忘れよう。"
msgstr ""

#. Swimming Lessons Mk. II
msgctxt "#272 quest"
msgid "続・水練の稽古"
msgstr ""

#. Determined not to let Instructor
#. Neithardt get the better of her,
#. Instructor Sara has decided to give the
#. girls of Class VII swimming lessons.
#. 
#. ...That's great, but why'd she have
#. to drag me into all this?
msgctxt "#272 desc"
msgid ""
"ナイトハルト教官に対抗心を燃やす\n"
"　サラ教官がⅦ組の女子連中に\n"
"　水練の指導を行うことに。\n"
"\n"
"　なぜか俺も参加することになったが……"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・Much like Neithardt's lessons, we
#. kicked things off by racing each other.
#. I raced Alisa first.
msgctxt "#273 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・ナイトハルト教官の時と同じく、\n"
"　とりあえず競争から始めることになり、\n"
"　最初はアリサと泳ぐことに。"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・Much like Neithardt's lessons, we
#. kicked things off by racing each other.
#. I raced Laura first.
msgctxt "#274 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・ナイトハルト教官の時と同じく、\n"
"　とりあえず競争から始めることになり、\n"
"　最初はラウラと泳ぐことに。"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・Much like Neithardt's lessons, we
#. kicked things off by racing each other.
#. I raced Emma first.
msgctxt "#275 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・ナイトハルト教官の時と同じく、\n"
"　とりあえず競争から始めることになり、\n"
"　最初はエマと泳ぐことに。"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・Much like Neithardt's lessons, we
#. kicked things off by racing each other.
#. I raced Fie first.
msgctxt "#276 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・ナイトハルト教官の時と同じく、\n"
"　とりあえず競争から始めることになり、\n"
"　最初はフィーと泳ぐことに。"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・Much like Neithardt's lessons, we
#. kicked things off by racing each other.
#. I raced Millium first.
msgctxt "#277 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・ナイトハルト教官の時と同じく、\n"
"　とりあえず競争から始めることになり、\n"
"　最初はミリアムと泳ぐことに。"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・Much like Neithardt's lessons, we
#. kicked things off by racing each other.
#. I raced Instructor Sara first.
msgctxt "#278 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・ナイトハルト教官の時と同じく、\n"
"　とりあえず競争から始めることになり、\n"
"　最初はサラ教官と泳ぐことに。"
msgstr ""

#. I won against her, too.
msgctxt "#279 step"
msgid "結果──勝つことができた。"
msgstr ""

#. I lost against her, though...
msgctxt "#280 step"
msgid "結果──負けてしまった。"
msgstr ""

#. Afterwards, we agreed to Millium's idea
#. of playing underwater tag until our stamina
#. gave out. Naturally, this led to some
#. unfortunate accidents, but eventually
#. our exhausting training came to an end.
msgctxt "#281 step"
msgid ""
"・その後、ミリアムの提案で俺たちは\n"
"　体力の続くまで水中で鬼ごっこを行う。\n"
"　ちょっとしたハプニングもあったが……\n"
"　厳しくも楽しく訓練することができた！"
msgstr ""

#. The Sleeping Boy
msgctxt "#282 quest"
msgid "眠り入った男の子"
msgstr ""

#. I practically stumbled over a boy
#. named Kurt asleep in the church.
#. 
#. Rosine and I decided to work
#. together to get him home safely.
msgctxt "#282 desc"
msgid ""
"教会で眠っていた\n"
"　男の子・クルト君を偶然発見──\n"
"\n"
"　ロジーヌさんと二人で協力し、\n"
"　一緒に家まで送り届けることに。"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・I carried Kurt home as Rosine held an
#. umbrella over me. Together, we were able
#. to get him home without waking him up.
msgctxt "#283 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・俺がクルト君を抱きかかえ、\n"
"　ロジーヌさんに傘を差してもらいつつ、\n"
"　クルト君を起こさないまま家まで送り届けた。"
msgstr ""

#. Arseid School Training Bout
msgctxt "#284 quest"
msgid "門下生との手合わせ"
msgstr ""

#. I wish for Lady Laura and you, her
#. classmates, to engage in a friendly
#. training bout against students of the
#. Arseid school.
#. 
#. When you have prepared sufficiently,
#. please make your way to the training
#. hall, which is down the stairs outside
#. the mansion and to the right.
#.                           --Klaus
msgctxt "#284 desc"
msgid ""
"ラウラお嬢様、並びにご学友の皆様に\n"
"　アルゼイド流門下生たちとの\n"
"　手合わせをお願いしたく存じます。\n"
"　\n"
"　準備が整いましたら、屋敷を下った先にある\n"
"　練武場までお越し下さいませ。\n"
"　　　　　　　　　　　　　──執事クラウス"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・After facing off against the students of
#. the Arseid school, Laura, Millium, Emma,
#. and I were challenged by Klaus himself.
msgctxt "#285 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・門下生との手合わせを終えた後、\n"
"　俺、ラウラ、ミリアム、エマの４人で\n"
"　クラウスさんと手合わせを行う。"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・After facing off against the students of
#. the Arseid school, Laura, Millium, Jusis,
#. and I were challenged by Klaus himself.
msgctxt "#286 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・門下生との手合わせを終えた後、\n"
"　俺、ラウラ、ミリアム、ユーシスの４人で\n"
"　クラウスさんと手合わせを行う。"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・After facing off against the students of
#. the Arseid school, Laura, Millium, Gaius,
#. and I were challenged by Klaus himself.
msgctxt "#287 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・門下生との手合わせを終えた後、\n"
"　俺、ラウラ、ミリアム、ガイウスの４人で\n"
"　クラウスさんと手合わせを行う。"
msgstr ""

#. The battle was fierce, but we emerged
#. victorious against Klaus, fulfilling
#. his request!
msgctxt "#288 step"
msgid "・クラウスさんに何とか勝利し、依頼を達成した！"
msgstr ""

#. Ebel Highway Monster
msgctxt "#289 quest"
msgid "エベル街道の手配魔獣"
msgstr ""

#. A monster's been spotted roving the
#. Ebel Highway, and he's a big one!
#. 
#. Monster: Crocodark
#. Location: Ebel Highway
#. 
#. I request that Class VII deal with this
#. threat as soon as they possibly can.
#.                           --Toval
msgctxt "#289 desc"
msgid ""
"街道に危険な大型魔獣が出現中。\n"
"　\n"
"　魔獣：【サメゲーター】\n"
"　場所：エベル街道\n"
"　\n"
"　特科クラスⅦ組による速やかなる\n"
"　討伐を願う。\n"
"　　　　　　　　　　　　──遊撃士トヴァル"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・That Crocodark is croco-done.
#. Better let Toval know.
msgctxt "#290 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・手配魔獣を退治した！\n"
"　トヴァルさんに報告しに行こう。"
msgstr ""

#. Now that we've told Toval, we can
#. scratch that request off the list!
msgctxt "#291 step"
msgid "・トヴァルさんに報告し、依頼を達成した！"
msgstr ""

#. Many Hands Make Light Work
msgctxt "#292 quest"
msgid "街道灯の一斉交換"
msgstr ""

#. I need someone to replace a lot of
#. orbment lights all along the highway.
#. 
#. If you like putting lights into things,
#. you can find me in Watteau's store.
#.                          --Duncan
msgctxt "#292 desc"
msgid ""
"街道灯の一斉交換を\n"
"　お願いしたいと思います。\n"
"　\n"
"　詳しくは、《ワトー商店》のダンカンまで。\n"
"　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　──ダンカン"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・Apparently the lights in the road lamps
#. along the Ebel Highway have been worn down,
#. and they all need replacing. That means we've
#. got fourteen lamps that need their lights
#. replaced. Let's do this.
msgctxt "#293 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・エベル街道の街道灯に劣化が見られたらしく、\n"
"　まとめて交換することに。\n"
"　数は全部で１４箇所、確実にこなそう。"
msgstr ""

#. Seven down, seven to go!
#. We're halfway there!
msgctxt "#294 step"
msgid ""
"・７箇所で導力灯を交換。\n"
"　残りはあと半分、一気に片付けよう。"
msgstr ""

#. We've exchanged all of the orbment
#. lights. Let's go tell Duncan.
msgctxt "#295 step"
msgid ""
"・全ての導力灯を交換した。\n"
"　ダンカンさんに報告しに行こう。"
msgstr ""

#. We showed Duncan that nobody replaces
#. lights like we do. Nobody.
msgctxt "#296 step"
msgid "・ダンカンさんに報告し、依頼を達成した！"
msgstr ""

#. Ebel Highway Monster 2
msgctxt "#297 quest"
msgid "エベル街道の手配魔獣②"
msgstr ""

#. There's another monster on the Ebel
#. Highway, but we don't know what KIND
#. of monster it is.
#. 
#. Monster: Details unknown
#. Location: Ebel Highway
#. 
#. Don't let me down, Class VII. Get this
#. taken care of a.s.a.p.
#.                              --Toval
msgctxt "#297 desc"
msgid ""
"街道に危険な大型魔獣が出現中。\n"
"　\n"
"　魔獣：詳細不明\n"
"　場所：エベル街道\n"
"　\n"
"　特科クラスⅦ組による速やかなる\n"
"　討伐を願う。　　　　　　　　　\n"
"　　　　　　　　　　　　──遊撃士トヴァル"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・We took that monster down! We should
#. tell Toval as soon as we get the chance.
msgctxt "#298 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・手配魔獣を退治した！\n"
"　トヴァルさんに報告しに行こう。"
msgstr ""

#. Another beaten monster means another
#. completed request.
msgctxt "#299 step"
msgid "・トヴァルさんに報告し、依頼を達成した！"
msgstr ""

#. An Offering to the Departed
msgctxt "#300 quest"
msgid "慰霊の供え物"
msgstr ""

#. I would like to practice making an
#. offering to St. Sandlot.
#. 
#. Would you be willing to help me gather
#. the materials necessary to do so?
#. 
#. If so, come see me at Legram Chapel.
#.                       --Sister Theramis
msgctxt "#300 desc"
msgid ""
"聖女様へのお供え物をこしらえる\n"
"　練習をしたいと考えています。\n"
"　\n"
"　どうか、そのための材料調達を\n"
"　手伝っていただけないでしょうか。\n"
"\n"
"　詳しくは七耀教会・レグラム礼拝堂まで。\n"
"　　　　　　　　　　──シスター・セラミス"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・We'll need to gather the following:
#. 1) Hearty Powder x5
#. 2) Clear Gelatin x5
#. 3) White Seed
#. We can get the first two from monsters,
#. but we'll need to get the third from
#. the Arseid household's head chef.
msgctxt "#301 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・必要な材料は以下──\n"
"　①魔獣の粉末×５\n"
"　②魔獣のゼラチン×５\n"
"　③ホワイトシード\n"
"　この内、ホワイトシードは、\n"
"　アルゼイド家の料理長にお願いしてみることに。"
msgstr ""

#. Josef gave us some white seed
msgctxt "#302 step"
msgid "・ヨーゼフさんにホワイトシードを譲ってもらった。"
msgstr ""

#. We delivered all the ingredients to
#. Sister Theramis and she let us try some
#. of the food she made. We'll leave the
#. remainder as an offering to St. Sandlot.
msgctxt "#303 step"
msgid ""
"・シスターに材料を届け、試食までさせてもらった。\n"
"　せっかくなので、聖女の像にお供えすることに。"
msgstr ""

#. We told Sister Theramis about our offering,
#. completing her request!
msgctxt "#304 step"
msgid "・お供えをしシスターに報告、依頼を達成した！"
msgstr ""

#. A Golden Catch
msgctxt "#305 quest"
msgid "幻の魚を求めて"
msgstr ""

#. Calling all fishermen! Could someone
#. catch me the elusive gold salmon?
#. Find me at the Aprikoze Inn for more
#. detailed information.
#.                     --Weiber
msgctxt "#305 desc"
msgid ""
"幻の魚《ゴルドサモーナ》を\n"
"　取ってきていただけませんか。\n"
"\n"
"　詳しくは、宿酒場《アプリコーゼ》の\n"
"　ウェイバーまで。\n"
"　　　　　　　　　　　　　　──ウェイバー"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆ 
#. ・Weiber claims that Toval spotted a gold
#. salmon in a river just off the highway.
#. We should go take a look for ourselves.
msgctxt "#306 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・ウェイバーさん曰く、最近トヴァルさんが\n"
"　街道の外れの川でゴルドサモーナを見かけたそうだ。\n"
"　とりあえず街道の川に出向こう。"
msgstr ""

#. We arrived at the river only to find that
#. somebody had beaten us there. Even more
#. surprisingly, she challenged us to see who
#. could catch a gold salmon first.
msgctxt "#307 step"
msgid ""
"・川に行くと先客がおり、なぜか先にどちらが\n"
"　ゴルドサモーナを釣り上げるか競う流れに。"
msgstr ""

#. We caught a gold salmon! Weiber's
#. going to be so excited.
msgctxt "#308 step"
msgid ""
"・ゴルドサモーナを釣り上げた！\n"
"　ウェイバーさんに報告しに行こう。"
msgstr ""

#. When we delivered the fish to Weiber,
#. he let us taste some of it. Awesome!
msgctxt "#309 step"
msgid "・ウェイバーさんに魚を届け、試食までさせてもらった！"
msgstr ""

#. Charm of the Eisenritter
msgctxt "#310 quest"
msgid "鉄騎隊の御守り"
msgstr ""

#. We agreed to find some luminous grass
#. for Cindy.
#. 
#. She needs it to make a charm that traces
#. its origins back to the Eisenritter.
msgctxt "#310 desc"
msgid ""
"シンディさんのお願いを聞く形で\n"
"　グローグラスという花を探すことに。\n"
"\n"
"　どうやら鉄騎隊にまつわる御守りを\n"
"　作るために必要らしい。"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・Apparently, luminous grass isn't grass at
#. all, but a flower that can only be found when
#. the fog clears in this region. People have
#. seen it on Ebel Highway. It's supposed to be
#. more common in areas with higher elevation.
msgctxt "#311 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・グローグラスは霧の晴れた時に咲く白い花で、\n"
"　エベル街道で見つかるらしい。\n"
"　周りと比べて高い所に咲くことが多いとのこと。"
msgstr ""

#. We found some luminous grass! Let's get
#. this to Cindy as soon as we can!
msgctxt "#312 step"
msgid ""
"・グローグラスを手に入れた。\n"
"　さっそくシンディさんに渡しに行こう。"
msgstr ""

#. We gave Cindy the luminous grass!
msgctxt "#313 step"
msgid "・シンディさんにグローグラスを渡した！"
msgstr ""

#. Old Schoolhouse Mystery VI
msgctxt "#314 quest"
msgid "旧校舎地下の調査⑥"
msgstr ""

#. Good Mr. Schwarzer, we have come to an
#. amusing juncture at which, even were I
#. to submit a blank request form, you
#. would naturally assume my intent to be
#. an investigation of the old
#. schoolhouse, and so it is once again.
#.                   --Principal Vandyck
msgctxt "#314 desc"
msgid ""
"先月に引き続き、旧校舎地下の調査を\n"
"　特科クラス《Ⅶ組》に依頼する。\n"
"　\n"
"　かの場所で起きている\n"
"　多くの不可思議な現象について\n"
"　調べを進めてほしい。\n"
"　\n"
"　万全に準備を整えた上で、\n"
"　諸君らの判断で始めてくれたまえ。\n"
"　　　　　　　　　　──ヴァンダイク学院長"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#.  ・All of the lights on the elevator panel
#. are lit and we can now descend all the way
#. to the sixth floor. There's no telling what
#. awaits us now.
msgctxt "#315 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・新たに第６層へ行けるようになったようだが……\n"
"　どうやらパネルのランプはこれで全て点灯したようだ。\n"
"　とにかく探索を始めよう。"
msgstr ""

#. ・We defeated an unbelievably powerful foe
#. and...nothing happened. Not much to do now
#. but go home for the day.
msgctxt "#316 step"
msgid ""
"・第６層の最奥にて強力な敵を倒したが、\n"
"　特に何も起きる様子はなかった。\n"
"　……とりあえず、そろそろ旧校舎を出よう。"
msgstr ""

#. ・It's hard to believe, but that spells
#. the end of our schoolhouse investigations.
msgctxt "#317 step"
msgid "・旧校舎の探索を無事に終えた！"
msgstr ""

#. A Personal Request
msgctxt "#318 quest"
msgid "個人的な依頼"
msgstr ""

#. Rean, I have to ask you to do me a
#. favor.
#. 
#. I'll be in the training hall on the
#. first floor of the gym. If you come,
#. come prepared.
#.                     --Angelica Rogner
msgctxt "#318 desc"
msgid ""
"リィン君に個人的に頼みたいことがある。\n"
"　\n"
"　ギムナジウム１Ｆの修練場にて待つ。\n"
"　気が向いたら足を運んでくれたまえ。\n"
"　　　　　　　　　──アンゼリカ・ログナー"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#.  ・Turns out that by 'favor,'  Angelica
#. meant 'duel.'
msgctxt "#319 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・アンゼリカ先輩の頼みというのは手合わせだった。"
msgstr ""

#. ・I was able to emerge victorious, but it wasn't
#. easy. Angelica's a practitioner of Taito, and
#. she's no slouch in a fight.
msgctxt "#320 step"
msgid ""
"何とか勝利を収めることができたが、\n"
"　アンゼリカ先輩は東方の泰斗流を修めているらしく、\n"
"　その実力は相当なものだった。"
msgstr ""

#. I agreed to fight her...and was thoroughly
#. trounced. Angelica's been studying Taito
#. for a long time and it shows.
msgctxt "#321 step"
msgid ""
"結果は敗北──\n"
"　アンゼリカ先輩は東方の泰斗流を修めているらしく、\n"
"　その実力は相当なものだった。"
msgstr ""

#. From Heart to Stomach
msgctxt "#322 quest"
msgid "手料理のプレゼント"
msgstr ""

#. I'm thinking about making some food as a
#. present for someone, but I don't know
#. what to make! It's gotta be something
#. that screams 'me,' y'know? I think I'll
#. need someone's help to figure that out.
#. 
#. If you've got a stomach of steel and
#. can help me out, meet me in the
#. cafeteria kitchen in the Student Union!
#.               ㈱ Mint, Year 1, Class III
msgctxt "#322 desc"
msgid ""
"ある人に手料理をプレゼントしようと\n"
"　思っているんだけど、\n"
"　どんなものがいいのか困っています。\n"
"　\n"
"　私らしい、とっておきの料理を作るため、\n"
"　どうか協力してくれないかな。\n"
"　\n"
"　詳しくは学生会館・食堂の厨房まで。\n"
"　\n"
"　　　　　　　　　　　──１年Ⅲ組・ミント"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・Mint asked me to bring her a number of
#. dishes that I would describe as 'superb' to
#. fuel the fires of her cooking passion.
#. ・She needs three dishes in all -- one soup,
#. one main, and one dessert. Once I've chosen
#. my three, I'll bring them her way.
msgctxt "#323 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・ミントのインスピレーションを刺激するため、\n"
"　俺が絶品と感じる料理をいくつか提供することに。\n"
"・必要なのは『スープ』『メインディッシュ』\n"
"　『デザート』の３品。\n"
"　用意して持って行こう。"
msgstr ""

#. I gave Mint my three chosen dishes and
#. she managed to whip up the Mint Special α.
#. It was a little too unique for my palate,
#. but she made it with love, and that's what
#. counts...probably. Either way, that's one
#. more request taken care of!
msgctxt "#324 step"
msgid ""
"・ミントに料理を３品提供し、\n"
"　『ミントスペシャルα』が完成。\n"
"　多少クセはあるが、\n"
"　愛情の感じられる一品だった。\n"
"・とにかく、これで依頼は達成だ。"
msgstr ""

#. I gave Mint my three chosen dishes and
#. she managed to whip up the Mint Special β.
#. It was a little too unique for my palate,
#. but she made it with love, and that's what
#. counts...probably. Either way, that's one
#. more request taken care of!
msgctxt "#325 step"
msgid ""
"・ミントに料理を３品提供し、\n"
"　『ミントスペシャルβ』が完成。\n"
"　多少クセはあるが、\n"
"　愛情の感じられる一品だった。\n"
"・とにかく、これで依頼は達成だ。"
msgstr ""

#. I gave Mint my three chosen dishes and
#. she managed to whip up the Mint Special Ω.
#. It was a little too unique for my palate,
#. but she made it with love, and that's what
#. counts...probably. Either way, that's one
#. more request taken care of!
msgctxt "#326 step"
msgid ""
"・ミントに料理を３品提供し、\n"
"　『ミントスペシャルΩ』が完成。\n"
"　多少クセはあるが、\n"
"　愛情の感じられる一品だった。\n"
"・とにかく、これで依頼は達成だ。"
msgstr ""

#. Celestin's Secret
msgctxt "#327 quest"
msgid "執事の隠し事"
msgstr ""

#. Patrick told me that Celestin's been
#. acting very strange lately, and it sounds
#. like it's more than just his imagination.
#. 
#. I agreed to look into Celestin's behavior
#. without arousing his suspicions. First
#. stop: the upper class dormitory.
msgctxt "#327 desc"
msgid ""
"パトリックからセレスタンさんの様子が\n"
"　いつもと違うことを聞かされ、\n"
"　それとなく事情を窺うことに。\n"
"　\n"
"　何かあることは間違いなさそうだが……\n"
"　とりあえず、第１学生寮に行ってみよう。"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・I visited the upper class dormitory, but
#. Celestin was nowhere to be found. When I
#. asked Lotte, she told me he'd gone to our
#. dorm to collect something from Sharon.
msgctxt "#328 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・第１学生寮に出向くも、セレスタンさんは留守だった。\n"
"　ロッテさん曰く、何でも\n"
"　シャロンさんから受け取るものがあるらしく\n"
"　第３学生寮の方に出かけたそうだ。"
msgstr ""

#. Sharon told me that she'd made too much
#. food and Celestin had come to collect
#. some. He also mentioned he'd be stopping
#. by Kirsche's later, so let's meet him there.
msgctxt "#329 step"
msgid ""
"・シャロンさんからおかずのお裾分けを受け取った\n"
"　セレスタンさんは、帰りに《キルシェ》に寄ろうかと\n"
"　言っていたらしい。"
msgstr ""

#. I found Celestin at Kirsche's. After a brief
#. discussion about Patrick, he challenged me to
#. a little card game.
#. ・After I won, he shared some of the
#. reasons for his recent behavior with
#. me. I should pass them on to Patrick.
msgctxt "#330 step"
msgid ""
"・キルシェでセレスタンさんを見つけ、\n"
"　パトリックの話をすると\n"
"　ブレードを使ったシャッフルゲームを行うことに。\n"
"・結果は勝利──事情を軽く聞かせてもらった。\n"
"　とりあえず、パトリックに報告しに行こう。"
msgstr ""

#. I found Celestin at Kirsche's. After a brief
#. discussion about Patrick, he challenged me to
#. a little card game.
#. ・Because I lost, he refused to tell me
#. why he'd been acting so strangely. That
#. said, he did promise to tell Patrick the
#. truth, so I should let him know.
msgctxt "#331 step"
msgid ""
"・キルシェでセレスタンさんを見つけ、\n"
"　パトリックの話をすると\n"
"　ブレードを使ったシャッフルゲームを行うことに。\n"
"・結果は敗北──詳しい事情は聞けなかったが、\n"
"　改めてパトリックに話すことを約束してもらう。\n"
"　とりあえず、パトリックに報告しに行こう。"
msgstr ""

#. I told Patrick everything
#. I learned from Celestin!
msgctxt "#332 step"
msgid "・パトリックにセレスタンさんのことを伝えた！"
msgstr ""

#. Mining a Minor Metal
msgctxt "#333 quest"
msgid "希少金属の捜索"
msgstr ""

#. I'm looking for a particularly rare sort
#. of metal for my research, but I'm afraid
#. I can't get it myself.
#. 
#. If you're willing to help, I'll be in
#. the western part of the upper level of
#. the Roer Institute of Technology.
#.                           --Ratto
msgctxt "#333 desc"
msgid ""
"ある稀少な研究材料の調達を\n"
"　お願いできないでしょうか。\n"
"　\n"
"　上層西側エリアにある\n"
"　《ルーレ工科大学》にてお待ちしています。\n"
"　　　　　　　　　　　　　──研究員ラット"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・Ratto needed linium, a minor metal we can
#. get from the Sachsen Iron Mine.
#. ・Apparently, the mine shaft where we could
#. obtain linium has been sealed off due to the
#. appearance of a dangerous monster. We'll
#. need to be doubly careful now.
msgctxt "#334 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・ザクセン鉄鉱山に向かい、\n"
"　『リニウム鉱』というレアメタルを調達してくることに。\n"
"・『リニウム鉱』が採取できる坑道には\n"
"　手強い魔獣が出るらしく、現在は封鎖されているらしい。\n"
"　注意して向かおう。"
msgstr ""

#. We were given the key to the mine shaft
#. by the chief miner. Let's get exploring.
msgctxt "#335 step"
msgid ""
"・鉱山長から坑道の鍵を受け取った。\n"
"　さっそく探索しよう。"
msgstr ""

#. They weren't kidding about that monster.
#. We beat him, though, and managed to get
#. our hands on some linium, which it seems
#. to have swallowed. I hope Ratto's happy...
msgctxt "#336 step"
msgid ""
"・奥で巨大な魔獣と交戦し、『リニウム鉱』を手に入れた。\n"
"　どうやら魔獣が飲み込んでいたようだ。\n"
"　とにかく、ラットさんに届けよう。"
msgstr ""

#. Linium delivered!
msgctxt "#337 step"
msgid "・ラットさんに『リニウム鉱』を渡し、依頼を達成した！"
msgstr ""

#. Can You Hear Me Now?
msgctxt "#338 quest"
msgid "ＡＲＣＵＳの通信強度調査"
msgstr ""

#. I'd like a hand with an experiment that
#. concerns your ARCUS units.
#. 
#. I will be waiting for you inside the
#. RF Store, and I'll tell you more when
#. I see you.
#.                            --Johann
msgctxt "#338 desc"
msgid ""
"君たちが持つＡＲＣＵＳを使って、\n"
"　ある調査を行ってもらいたい。\n"
"　\n"
"　《ＲＦストア》で待っているので、\n"
"　まずは話を聞きに来てくれるだろうか。\n"
"　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　──ヨハン"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・Johann gave us an orbal wave detector
#. and asked us to check every building in
#. Roer to find areas with a signal strength
#. of 1. This might take a while...
msgctxt "#339 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・ヨハン主任から『導力波測定器』を受け取った。\n"
"　これを使って屋内を一通り調査し、\n"
"　導力波レベルが１の場所を見つけ出そう。"
msgstr ""

#. The interior of Dining Bar - F has a
#. signal strength of 1!
msgctxt "#340 step"
msgid ""
"・レベル１の場所を発見！\n"
"　ダイニングバー《Ｆ》"
msgstr ""

#. The interior of Roer Cathedral has a
#. signal strength of 1!
msgctxt "#341 step"
msgid ""
"・レベル１の場所を発見！\n"
"　ルーレ大聖堂"
msgstr ""

#. The interior of Jackass' Repair Shop
#. has a signal strength of 1!
msgctxt "#342 step"
msgid ""
"・レベル１の場所を発見！\n"
"　修理屋《ジャッカス》"
msgstr ""

#. The interior of The Roer Institute of
#. Technology has a signal strength of 1!
msgctxt "#343 step"
msgid ""
"・レベル１の場所を発見！\n"
"　ルーレ工科大学"
msgstr ""

#. The area in front of the sealed-off
#. door on Roer's upper level has a signal
#. strength of 1!
msgctxt "#344 step"
msgid ""
"・レベル１の場所を発見！\n"
"　屋外上層・封鎖された扉前"
msgstr ""

#. We told Johann about the three areas
#. we found. Hopefully that helped!
msgctxt "#345 step"
msgid ""
"・ヨハン主任に計３つのポイントを報告、\n"
"　依頼を達成した！"
msgstr ""

#. We told Johann about the four areas
#. we found. Hopefully that helped!
msgctxt "#346 step"
msgid ""
"・ヨハン主任に計４つのポイントを報告、\n"
"　依頼を達成した！"
msgstr ""

#. We told Johann about the five areas
#. we found. Hopefully that helped!
msgctxt "#347 step"
msgid ""
"・ヨハン主任に計５つのポイントを報告、\n"
"　依頼を達成した！"
msgstr ""

#. Spina Byroad Monster
msgctxt "#348 quest"
msgid "スピナ間道の手配魔獣"
msgstr ""

#. A powerful beast has appeared on the
#. Spina Byroad. The Nortia Provincial Army
#. hereby requests its extermination.
#. 
#. Monster: Rocky Croaker
#. Location: Spina Byroad. Take the left
#. path outside the city and turn left.
#. 
#. Once the monster is eliminated, please
#. report to the soldiers in front of
#. Marquis Rogner's residence.
msgctxt "#348 desc"
msgid ""
"スピナ間道に危険な魔獣が出現した。\n"
"　ノルティア州領邦軍より退治を依頼する。\n"
"　\n"
"　魔獣：【オオイシゲェロ】\n"
"　場所：スピナ間道・突き当たり左の先\n"
"　\n"
"　なお、魔獣退治を終えた後は\n"
"　ログナー侯爵家・敷地入口の前にいる\n"
"　兵士まで報告のこと。"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・The Rocky Croaker's croaked! Better
#. let the provincial army know.
msgctxt "#349 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・手配魔獣を退治した！\n"
"　領邦軍に報告しに行こう。"
msgstr ""

#. Another monster down and another
#. Provincial Army request fulfilled.
msgctxt "#350 step"
msgid "・領邦軍に報告し、依頼を達成した！"
msgstr ""

#. Midnight Hide-and-Seek
msgctxt "#351 quest"
msgid "真夜中のかくれんぼ"
msgstr ""

#. We found a child who claimed to be
#. playing some late-night hide-and-seek,
#. so we decided to help him find his friend.
#. 
#. Fie thinks he's probably somewhere on the
#. upper level of the city. We should look
#. for him anywhere that a child might hide.
msgctxt "#351 desc"
msgid ""
"夜遅くにかくれんぼをしているという\n"
"　子供を見かけ、探すのを手伝うことに。\n"
"　\n"
"　フィーの見立てでは、上層にいる可能性がある。\n"
"　子供が隠れそうな場所を探してみよう。"
msgstr ""

#. We found the child and made sure
#. that he returned home safely!
msgctxt "#352 step"
msgid "・子供を見つけ、無事に家に帰すことができた！"
msgstr ""

#. Nortia Highway Monster
msgctxt "#353 quest"
msgid "ノルティア街道の手配魔獣"
msgstr ""

#. A ferocious monster has appeared on the
#. Nortia Highway. The Nortia Provincial
#. Army hereby requests its extermination.
#. 
#. Monster: Hydra
#. Location: Open area off of Nortia Highway
#. 
#. Once the monster is eliminated, please
#. report to the soldiers in front of
#. Marquis Rogner's residence.
msgctxt "#353 desc"
msgid ""
"ノルティア街道に危険な魔獣が出現した。\n"
"　ノルティア州領邦軍より退治を依頼する。\n"
"　\n"
"　魔獣：【タトージャ】\n"
"　場所：ノルティア街道・外れの広場\n"
"　\n"
"　なお、魔獣退治を終えた後は\n"
"　ログナー侯爵家・敷地入口の前にいる\n"
"　兵士まで報告のこと。"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・That monster won't be bothering anyone
#. now! We should tell the provincial army.
msgctxt "#354 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・手配魔獣を退治した！\n"
"　領邦軍に報告しに行こう。"
msgstr ""

#. We've checked in with the army and the
#. highway is once again safe for travel.
msgctxt "#355 step"
msgid "・領邦軍に報告し、依頼を達成した！"
msgstr ""

#. Shots Fired
msgctxt "#356 quest"
msgid "ガンユニットのテスト"
msgstr ""

#. Those of us at Reinford's 2nd Factory
#. have developed a new type of orbal gun
#. and we'd like to have it tested.
#. 
#. Speak with me in RF Arms if you fancy
#. giving it a shot.
#.                             --Sandy
msgctxt "#356 desc"
msgid ""
"我々『第二製作所』が、\n"
"　新たに開発した新型導力銃を\n"
"　テストしていただきたいと思います。\n"
"　\n"
"　詳しい内容は《ＲＦアームズ》にて。\n"
"　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　──サンディ"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・Sandy gave us a shotgun, which we promptly
#. shoved into Machias' hands.
#. ・We need to use it to defeat ten Dancing Owls
#. on the Sachsen Mountain path. All of us can
#. weaken them, but the final blow needs to be
#. dealt with the shotgun.
msgctxt "#357 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・サンディ主任からマキアス用の\n"
"　ショットガンを受け取った。\n"
"・ザクセン山道に出向き、\n"
"　受け取った武器でダンシングオゥルを\n"
"　１０体倒そう。\n"
"　１人で倒さなくても\n"
"　トドメを刺せれば大丈夫とのこと。"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・Sandy gave us a pair of gunswords, which Fie
#. will be making use of.
#. ・We need to use them to defeat ten Dancing Owls
#. on the Sachsen Mountain path. All of us can
#. weaken them, but the final blow needs to be
#. dealt with the gunswords.
msgctxt "#358 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・サンディ主任からフィー用の\n"
"　双銃剣を受け取った。\n"
"・ザクセン山道に出向き、\n"
"　受け取った武器でダンシングオゥルを\n"
"　１０体倒そう。\n"
"　１人で倒さなくても\n"
"　トドメを刺せれば大丈夫とのこと。"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・Sandy gave us a pair of pistols, which Crow
#. happily accepted.
#. ・We need to use them to defeat ten Dancing
#. Owls on the Sachsen Mountain path. All of us
#. can weaken them, but the final blow needs to
#. be dealt with the pistols.
msgctxt "#359 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・サンディ主任からクロウ用の\n"
"　二丁拳銃を受け取った。\n"
"・ザクセン山道に出向き、\n"
"　受け取った武器でダンシングオゥルを\n"
"　１０体倒そう。\n"
"　１人で倒さなくても\n"
"　トドメを刺せれば大丈夫とのこと。"
msgstr ""

#. We've defeated ten Dancing Owls now.
#. We should give Sandy our report.
msgctxt "#360 step"
msgid ""
"・ダンシングオゥルを１０体撃破。\n"
"　サンディ主任に報告しに行こう。"
msgstr ""

#. We gave Sandy the test
#. information he needed!
msgctxt "#361 step"
msgid "・サンディ主任に報告し、依頼を達成した！"
msgstr ""

#. Crying Over Lost Milk
msgctxt "#362 quest"
msgid "迷い猫の大捜索"
msgstr ""

#. Milk is missing! Could you please help
#. us find our beloved little kitty?
#. 
#. Any would-be heroes should come talk to
#. me at my house next to Dining Bar - F.
#.                        ~Vanilla
msgctxt "#362 desc"
msgid ""
"うちのミルクちゃんが\n"
"　迷子になってしまったので、\n"
"　どうか探してもらえないでしょうか。\n"
"　\n"
"　詳しくは、バニラまで。\n"
"　ちなみに我が家は\n"
"　ダイニングバー《Ｆ》の左手にあります。\n"
"　\n"
"　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　──バニラ"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・Milk is distinguishable by her brown and
#. white fur and yellow collar. She's a very
#. cautious cat, so she tends to avoid places
#. with a lot of people. She also likes to
#. crawl under things. All of the evidence
#. points to her being outdoors.
msgctxt "#363 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・ミルクの特徴は、白と茶色の毛に黄色い首輪。\n"
"　警戒心がとても強いため、\n"
"　人が多く集まるような場所は苦手らしい。\n"
"　また、何かの下に潜り込むのが大好きとのこと。\n"
"　とりあえず屋外を中心に探そう。"
msgstr ""

#. We found Milk under a bench near the Roer
#. Institute of Technology, but she ran off.
msgctxt "#364 step"
msgid ""
"・工科大学の近くのベンチでミルクを発見。\n"
"　だが逃げられてしまった。"
msgstr ""

#. We found Milk under another bench near
#. the diner, but she slipped away again.
msgctxt "#365 step"
msgid ""
"・居酒屋の近くのベンチでミルクを発見。\n"
"　だが再び逃げられてしまった。"
msgstr ""

#. We discovered Milk under a bench, but she
#. got away from us a third time and ran into
#. the station.
#. ・We received permission from a station
#. employee to check the train car Milk
#. probably entered.
msgctxt "#366 step"
msgid ""
"・駅の近くのベンチでミルクを発見。\n"
"　だがまたまた逃げられ、今度は駅に入ってしまった。\n"
"・駅員さんに許可を取り、\n"
"　ミルクが乗り込んだと思われる車両を探すことに。"
msgstr ""

#. We reunited Vanilla and Milk! ...But
#. why am I suddenly hungry for cookies?
msgctxt "#367 step"
msgid ""
"・ミルクを無事に発見しバニラさんに報告、\n"
"　依頼を達成した！"
msgstr ""

#. Slipped Their Minds
msgctxt "#368 quest"
msgid "飲食営業許可証の配達"
msgstr ""

#. A number of students have yet to collect
#. their permission slips to serve food
#. and drinks at the festival. Given that
#. it's imperative that everyone doing so
#. has a slip, I need them delivered today.
#. 
#. For more details, speak to me in the
#. infirmary.
#.                 --Instructor Beatrix
msgctxt "#368 desc"
msgid ""
"学院祭で飲食営業をする許可証を\n"
"　受け取りにきていない生徒がいるようです。\n"
"　重要な物だから今日中に\n"
"　渡しておいてもらえないかしら。\n"
"　\n"
"　詳しくは医務室で説明しましょう。\n"
"　　　　　　　　　　　──ベアトリクス教官"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・Instructor Beatrix gave me four slips
#. to deliver to the following four people.
#. 1) Nicholas in the Cooking Club
#. 2) Colette, a first year in Class IV
#. 3) Becky, who's running her own stall.
#. 4) Hugo, who's also running one of his.
msgctxt "#369 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・ベアトリクス教官から\n"
"　『飲食営業許可証』を４枚受け取った。\n"
"　届け先は以下──\n"
"　①調理部：ニコラス部長\n"
"　②１年Ⅳ組：コレット\n"
"　③個人屋台：ベッキー\n"
"　④個人屋台：ヒューゴ"
msgstr ""

#. I went to the Cooking Club's clubroom,
#. but it seems like Nicholas went out to
#. buy supplies. I guess I'll have to find
#. him at Brandon's General Goods.
msgctxt "#370 step"
msgid ""
"・調理部に行ったが、ニコラス部長は\n"
"　雑貨屋に出かけたそうだ。\n"
"　直接届けに行こう。"
msgstr ""

#. I delivered Nicholas' permission slip.
msgctxt "#371 step"
msgid "・ニコラス部長に許可証を届けた。"
msgstr ""

#. Colette wasn't in Class IV's first-year
#. classroom, but I heard she was in their
#. second-year classroom. Better get going.
msgctxt "#372 step"
msgid ""
"・１年Ⅳ組の教室にコレットはいなかった。\n"
"　どうやら２年Ⅳ組の方にいるらしい。"
msgstr ""

#. I delivered Colette's permission slip.
msgctxt "#373 step"
msgid "・コレットに許可証を届けた。"
msgstr ""

#. I delivered Hugo and Becky's
#. permission slips.
msgctxt "#374 step"
msgid "・ヒューゴとベッキーに許可証を届けた。"
msgstr ""

#. Now that I've delivered all four
#. permission slips, I should let
#. Instructor Beatrix know.
msgctxt "#375 step"
msgid ""
"・４枚全て届けた。\n"
"　ベアトリクス教官に報告しに行こう。"
msgstr ""

#. I reported back to Instructor
#. Beatrix, completing her request!
msgctxt "#376 step"
msgid "・ベアトリクス教官に報告、依頼を達成した！"
msgstr ""

#. We Read the Comments
msgctxt "#377 quest"
msgid "インタビュー集め"
msgstr ""

#. We're doing a special feature here at
#. Radio Trista on the academy festival,
#. but we're running a little short on
#. comments. Anyone want to collect the
#. ones we need for me?
#. 
#. For more specifics, come see me in
#. the Radio Trista building.
#.     --Michael, director at Radio Trista
msgctxt "#377 desc"
msgid ""
"ラジオで学院祭の特集番組をやるんだが、\n"
"　まだ出し物について\n"
"　コメントしてくれてない所があってな。\n"
"　何とかもらってきちゃくれないか。\n"
"\n"
"　詳しくはラジオ局にて。\n"
"　　　　　　　　──ディレクター・マイケル"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・I need to collect comments from:
#. 1) A Class I first year
#. 2) A Class V first year
#. 3) The Occult Research Society
msgctxt "#378 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・コメントを回収する必要があるのは以下──\n"
"　①１年Ⅰ組\n"
"　②１年Ⅴ組\n"
"　③オカルト研究会"
msgstr ""

#. I received a comment from Ferris.
msgctxt "#379 step"
msgid "・フェリスからコメントをもらった。"
msgstr ""

#. I checked the training hall, but it turns
#. out Munk was in charge of making the
#. comment and he wasn't there. He might
#. be in the lower class dormitory, though.
msgctxt "#380 step"
msgid ""
"・練武場を訪れたが、コメント担当のムンクは\n"
"　まだ来ていないそうだ。\n"
"　第２学生寮の様子を見に行こう。"
msgstr ""

#. I received a comment from Munk.
msgctxt "#381 step"
msgid "・ムンクからコメントをもらった。"
msgstr ""

#. I received a comment from Beryl.
msgctxt "#382 step"
msgid "・ベリルからコメントをもらった。"
msgstr ""

#. I've gathered all three comments.
#. Time to let Michael know.
msgctxt "#383 step"
msgid ""
"・コメントを３つ集めた。\n"
"　マイケルさんに報告しに行こう。"
msgstr ""

#. I gave Michael the comments, so the
#. feature should go off without a hitch!
msgctxt "#384 step"
msgid "・マイケルさんにコメントを渡し、依頼を達成した！"
msgstr ""

#. Mail Mixup
msgctxt "#385 quest"
msgid "誤配達の荷物"
msgstr ""

#. Our class received a package that
#. clearly wasn't meant for us.
#. 
#. We want to get it to whichever class
#. ordered it, but we're too swamped with
#. our preparations to ask around. Could
#. someone please deliver this for us?
#. 
#. We'll be outside Class II's second-year
#. classroom preparing for the festival.
#. Please come see us if you can help.
#.              --Bridget, Year 1, Class II
msgctxt "#385 desc"
msgid ""
"私たちのクラスに\n"
"　間違った荷物が届いているようです。\n"
"　\n"
"　準備で手が離せないんです。\n"
"　正しい配達先に届けてもらえませんか。\n"
"　\n"
"　出し物の準備のため、\n"
"  ２年Ⅱ組の教室前にいます。\n"
"　お手数ですがこちらまでお越しください。\n"
"　　　　　　　　　──１年Ⅱ組・ブリジット"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・I picked up the package that'd been delivered
#. to Class II only to find cones inside... These
#. are probably going to be used for something on
#. the field.
msgctxt "#386 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・１年Ⅱ組に間違って届いたという荷物を受け取る。\n"
"　中身は三角コーン……グラウンドに関係ありそうだ。"
msgstr ""

#. It turns out the cones were meant for the
#. Riding Club. Not only did they not get their
#. package, but they got another one full of
#. newly-printed books, too. Now I have to figure
#. out who these are for...
msgctxt "#387 step"
msgid ""
"・三角コーンは馬術部への荷物だった。\n"
"　そして誤配達はここでも同じだったらしく、\n"
"　代わりに新品の本を受け取る。\n"
"　心当りを探そう。"
msgstr ""

#. I took the books to the bookstore and,
#. unsurprisingly, I was entrusted with yet another
#. package. This one contains copies of a handmade
#. short story anthology.
msgctxt "#388 step"
msgid ""
"・書店に荷物を渡し、代わりに誤配達の荷物を受け取る。\n"
"　どうやら中身は手製の文芸誌のようだ。"
msgstr ""

#. Once I delivered the anthologies, I was given
#. a package full of expensive-looking ornaments.
#. Given that Class II's contribution to the
#. festival has a fancy name like 'Stella Garten'...
msgctxt "#389 step"
msgid ""
"・文芸部に荷物を届け、代わりに\n"
"　高級そうな小物が入った荷物を受け取る。\n"
"　Ⅱ組の催しが確か『ステラガルテン』だったが……"
msgstr ""

#. We've finally come full circle. All of
#. the packages have been properly delivered!
msgctxt "#390 step"
msgid "・Ⅱ組に荷物を届け、依頼を達成した！"
msgstr ""

#. Duly Noted
msgctxt "#391 quest"
msgid "教頭の落し物"
msgstr ""

#. The vice principal seems to have lost
#. his notebook, and he seems desperate to
#. find it again. I'd like to help him out,
#. but it'd be easier if I knew where to
#. start...
msgctxt "#391 desc"
msgid ""
"教頭が手帳をなくしてしまったらしい。\n"
"　困っているようだし、\n"
"　暇をみて探してみよう。\n"
"　いずれにしても手がかりが欲しいが……"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
#. ・He mentioned something about dropping it
#. when he was on the roof of the main building...
msgctxt "#392 step"
msgid ""
"#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆\n"
"・教頭の独り言によると、\n"
"　どうやら屋上で落としたみたいだが……"
msgstr ""

#. It seems as though the vice principal was
#. facing out into the courtyard at one point,
#. but moved toward the academy field with his
#. notebook in hand. So maybe...
msgctxt "#393 step"
msgid ""
"・教頭は手帳を確認しながら\n"
"　中庭に面した位置からグラウンド側に\n"
"　移動したそうだ、とすると……"
msgstr ""

#. Apparently, a group of students found
#. something next to the field and headed off
#. somewhere quiet to look at it.
msgctxt "#394 step"
msgid ""
"・グラウンド脇で何かを見つけたと\n"
"　言っていた生徒がいたそうだ。\n"
"　『人の来ない場所で見る』と言っていたらしい。"
msgstr ""

#. Rex and his group of friends gave me a black
#. leather notebook. I should return this to the
#. vice principal a.s.a.p.
msgctxt "#395 step"
msgid ""
"・旧校舎前でレックスたちから黒革の手帳を受け取った。\n"
"　教頭の所へ持って行こう。"
msgstr ""

#. I gave the vice principal his notebook
#. back and learned all about Rixia Mao!
msgctxt "#396 step"
msgid "・教頭に手帳を渡した！"
msgstr ""

#. Academy Festival Patrol
msgctxt "#397 quest"
msgid "学院祭の見回り"
msgstr ""

#. I've agreed to help the Student Council
#. during the festival. I'll be walking
#. around and seeing if anyone needs help.
msgctxt "#397 desc"
msgid ""
"生徒会の手伝いを引き受けた。\n"
"　学院祭を巡回して\n"
"　各種トラブルに対応しよう。"
msgstr ""

#. #666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆
msgctxt "#398 step"
msgid "#666c　　　　          ◆　　　　◆　　　　◆"
msgstr ""

#. A couple asked me about Class III's
#. attraction and I was able to guide them properly!
msgctxt "#399 step"
msgid ""
"・来場者から１年Ⅲ組の催しについて聞かれ、\n"
"　正しく案内できた！"
msgstr ""

#. A couple asked me about Class III's
#. attraction and I couldn't help them out...
msgctxt "#400 step"
msgid ""
"・来場者から１年Ⅲ組の催しについて聞かれたが、\n"
"　正しく答えられなかった……"
msgstr ""

#. A girl on the rooftop has dropped her Mishy
#. plush. She apparently had it just a while ago,
#. so I should look around the main building for it.
msgctxt "#401 step"
msgid ""
"・屋上にいる女の子がみっしぃの\n"
"　ぬいぐるみを落としてしまったらしい。\n"
"　ついさっきまで持っていたらしいが……\n"
"　校舎内を探そう。"
msgstr ""

#. I found the girl's Mishy plush in the
#. main building and returned it to her!
msgctxt "#402 step"
msgid ""
"・校舎内でみっしぃのぬいぐるみを発見。\n"
"　女の子に届けた！"
msgstr ""

#. Becky asked me to find and deliver her ten
#. packs of Course Rock Salt.
msgctxt "#403 step"
msgid ""
"・ベッキーから粗挽き岩塩を\n"
"　１０個持ってくるよう頼まれた。"
msgstr ""

#. I gave Becky the salt she needed!
msgctxt "#404 step"
msgid "・ベッキーに食材を渡した！"
msgstr ""

#. A boy's balloon has been caught in a tree
#. near the field. I'll have to borrow a ladder
#. from the janitor to get it down.
msgctxt "#405 step"
msgid ""
"・グラウンド脇の木に\n"
"　男の子の風船が絡まってしまったようだ。\n"
"　用務員さんに脚立を借りてこよう。"
msgstr ""

#. I rescued the boy's balloon!
msgctxt "#406 step"
msgid "・脚立を使って風船を取ってあげた！"
msgstr ""

#. I found Vanilla lost in front of the old
#. schoolhouse. I should let Instructor Makarov
#. know where she is.
msgctxt "#407 step"
msgid ""
"・旧校舎の前で迷子のバニラさんを発見。\n"
"　マカロフ教官に連絡しよう。"
msgstr ""

#. I told Instructor Makarov about Vanilla!
msgctxt "#408 step"
msgid "・マカロフ教官にバニラさんのことを伝えた！"
msgstr ""

